<!doctype lake><title>𝑮𝒆𝒏𝑨𝑰-𝑺𝒂𝒌𝒖𝒓𝒂-𝑰𝑰𝑰</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="KMj1j" id="KMj1j" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u5ca67037" id="u5ca67037">🦜</span><span data-lake-id="uc7d01105" id="uc7d01105"> 𝐒𝐜𝐨𝐫𝐞-𝐁𝐚𝐬𝐞𝐝 𝐆𝐞𝐧𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐭𝐡𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐠𝐡 𝐒𝐭𝐨𝐜𝐡𝐚𝐬𝐭𝐢𝐜 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐚𝐥 𝐄𝐪𝐮𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="uad84a501" id="uad84a501"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue1693467" id="ue1693467">从数据中构造噪声是容易的，而从噪声中恢复数据则构成生成建模问题</span></strong></p><ul list="u7e9a3d9f"><li fid="ueaa6044f" data-lake-id="u8cb26769" id="u8cb26769"><span data-lake-id="u4ed41ca6" id="u4ed41ca6">论文提出一种随机微分方程（SDE）框架：其前向过程通过逐步注入噪声，将复杂数据分布平滑地转化为已知先验分布；相应地，逆向过程则通过逐步去噪，将先验分布重新映射回数据分布</span></li><li fid="ueaa6044f" data-lake-id="ud19675c2" id="ud19675c2"><span data-lake-id="ua0bf48b9" id="ua0bf48b9">关键在于，该逆时间 SDE 仅依赖于随时间变化的梯度场，即受扰动数据分布的得分函数（score）。借助基于得分生成建模领域的最新进展，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua947228f" id="ua947228f">​</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua4e99bfe" id="ua4e99bfe">利用神经网络对这些得分函数进行精确估计，并结合数值 SDE 求解器实现样本生成</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udd81e86c" id="udd81e86c"><strong><span data-lake-id="udaa436fd" id="udaa436fd">已有两类成功的概率生成模型都遵循“逐步加噪—再逆向恢复”的基本思想，将这两类方法统一归为基于得分的生成模型</span></strong></p><ul list="uce9e8d0e"><li fid="u2e802638" data-lake-id="ucfac92cb" id="ucfac92cb"><span data-lake-id="u25945954" id="u25945954">基于 Langevin 动力学的得分匹配方法（SMLD）在每个噪声尺度上估计得分函数，并在生成阶段通过 Langevin 动力学沿着逐步减小的噪声尺度进行采样</span></li><li fid="u2e802638" data-lake-id="u63aae817" id="u63aae817"><span data-lake-id="u44e2ca10" id="u44e2ca10">去噪扩散概率模型（DDPM）则学习一系列概率模型，以逐步逆转噪声破坏过程。对于连续状态空间而言，DDPM 的训练目标本质上也在各个噪声尺度上隐式估计得分函数</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u44b05163" id="u44b05163"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufbdcf464" id="ufbdcf464">在此基础上，进一步提出一个以 SDE 为核心的统一理论框架，用以概括并推广上述方法</span></strong></p><ul list="u26b9f684"><li fid="u0a29ed4f" data-lake-id="u28d454d5" id="u28d454d5"><span data-lake-id="u04e18d21" id="u04e18d21">与基于有限个离散噪声分布的建模方式不同，考虑的是一个随时间连续演化的分布族，其演化由预先设定、与具体数据点无关且不含可训练参数的前向 SDE 描述。通过逆转这一扩散过程，随机噪声可以被逐步塑造为数据样本</span></li><li fid="u0a29ed4f" data-lake-id="u5c6bd79c" id="u5c6bd79c"><span data-lake-id="u5b2b4982" id="u5b2b4982">更重要的是，只要已知各时刻边缘分布的得分函数，就能够由前向 SDE 推导出对应的逆时间 SDE。基于这一性质，通过训练一个时间依赖的神经网络来估计得分函数，并利用数值 SDE 求解器完成采样</span></li><li fid="u0a29ed4f" data-lake-id="ub05cb42f" id="ub05cb42f"><span data-lake-id="ue2cd15d5" id="ue2cd15d5">提出预测器—校正器（predictor-corrector）框架，以修正离散化逆时间 SDE 所带来的数值误差；同时推导出一个与 SDE 采样分布等价的神经常微分方程（ODE），从而支持精确似然计算并进一步提升采样效率</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0ad5a85e" id="u0ad5a85e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1774408633258-8a304b15-46ef-4303-9d60-f5030d9d34ec.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uae16717d-7cce-4021-9eb9-e49d11c7ecf%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue5128d9b-e803-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A564.2000122070312%2C%22height%22%3A238%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A333222%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A899%2C%22originHeight%22%3A380%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22F(X%2CT)-G(T)VXL0GD(X)DT%2BG(T)D%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%80X(%22%2C%22x%22%3A252%2C%22y%22%3A290%2C%22width%22%3A590%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REVERSESDE(NOISE%E4%B8%80DATA)%22%2C%22x%22%3A277%2C%22y%22%3A348%2C%22width%22%3A352%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORWARDSDE(DATANOISE%22%2C%22x%22%3A273%2C%22y%22%3A13%2C%22width%22%3A349%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DX%3DF(X%2CTDT%2BG(TDW%22%2C%22x%22%3A299%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A309%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SCOREFUNCTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A428%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A158%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X(0%22%2C%22x%22%3A20%2C%22y%22%3A288%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X(0%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80X(T)%22%2C%22x%22%3A759%2C%22y%22%3A285%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DX%3D%22%2C%22x%22%3A178%2C%22y%22%3A293%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%E4%B8%8A%22%2C%22x%22%3A807%2C%22y%22%3A52%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e5e3df%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2433049a%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u1aaeebee" id="u1aaeebee"><strong><span data-lake-id="u12780612" id="u12780612" style="color: #101E60"> 三个核心贡献：</span></strong></p><ul list="u89bea31e"><li fid="u857598a9" data-lake-id="u3fdf508c" id="u3fdf508c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u61156d8e" id="u61156d8e">灵活采样与似然计算</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub5c0a3b0" id="ub5c0a3b0">：提出统一的连续时间采样框架，不仅可以直接利用通用 SDE 求解器对逆时间过程进行采样，还进一步设计 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc25a2b86" id="uc25a2b86">Predictor-Corrector (PC) 采样器</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u69d00aa3" id="u69d00aa3"> 与 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uffec0278" id="uffec0278">probability flow ODE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u902269af" id="u902269af"> 两种关键机制，从而同时提升采样质量、采样效率以及精确似然计算能力</span></li><li fid="u857598a9" data-lake-id="u3c38dffd" id="u3c38dffd"><strong><span data-lake-id="ueead9084" id="ueead9084">可控生成能力</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u34e7beb4" id="u34e7beb4">：基于无条件得分函数也可以有效构造条件逆过程，因此无需重新训练模型，便能够支持类别条件生成、图像修复、图像上色等多种条件生成与逆问题求解任务，显著增强模型的可控性与适用范围</span></li><li fid="u857598a9" data-lake-id="u30996c4e" id="u30996c4e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2f06b342" id="u2f06b342">统一的理论框架</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1afd577f" id="u1afd577f">：以 SDE 为核心建立一个统一视角，将 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf4a73169" id="uf4a73169">SMLD</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u237274c8" id="u237274c8"> 与 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud1eb5448" id="ud1eb5448">DDPM</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u676dea33" id="u676dea33"> 解释为两类不同 SDE 的离散化形式，从而打通已有基于得分生成方法之间的联系，并为后续 SDE 设计、采样策略改进和生成性能优化提供统一理论基础</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="hzILC" id="hzILC" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ub84ed960" id="ub84ed960">🐦‍🔥</span><span data-lake-id="ud0ccccb2" id="ud0ccccb2"> 𝑩𝑨𝑪𝑲𝑮𝑹𝑶𝑼𝑵𝑫</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ud15c85e9" id="ud15c85e9"><span data-lake-id="uc596647e" id="uc596647e">设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%3B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2C%5C%5Csigma%5E2%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F81b6bd6fe9f9151c3bf55e749d60fd75.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xmWbd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc19cb825" id="uc19cb825">为一个扰动核，并定义</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D)%3A%3D%5C%5Cint%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5C%2Cp_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5ca8789bdd322a777975ac2f8416888c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e9MeB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u642056b0" id="u642056b0">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ad9dcdf713e124a72320dcdf2279074.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GoU1u%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3619bfa1" id="u3619bfa1">表示数据分布。进一步考虑一组递增的正噪声尺度序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%3D%5C%5Csigma_1%3C%5C%5Csigma_2%3C%5C%5Ccdots%3C%5C%5Csigma_N%3D%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6c7b3f35a390f83c734fa21cf7c98d03.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QOaxR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uae85cebb" id="uae85cebb">通常，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%E2%81%A1%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde7f0d9019bb86d9c336a11268752f78.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22omO6h%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u419b61fd" id="u419b61fd">足够小，从而满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Capprox%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa943f5fc0a5cc1e8c3041c9b30184ff8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q8GnF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ube68ab92" id="ube68ab92">而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%E2%81%A1%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e9cee2f02326887a07fa5eb94adaf8b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SM2SN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaca36ab1" id="uaca36ab1">足够大，从而有</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4b9df525" id="u4b9df525" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%5E2%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F149742d2146bf7f211c67bc44c6ee5a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qli62%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ufddaadd3" id="ufddaadd3"><span data-lake-id="u6af7c27c" id="u6af7c27c">Song 与 Ermon（2019）提出训练一种</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7676f52f" id="u7676f52f">噪声条件得分网络</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue7411855" id="ue7411855">，记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2C%5C%5Csigma)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1d449b4ce7be8fdd5ac85afcf6318135.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xqD0A%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubf09a6e5" id="ubf09a6e5">。其训练目标采用带权重的去噪得分匹配目标函数（Vincent, 2011）之和</span></p><p data-lake-id="u74d9e20c" id="u74d9e20c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B*%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%20%5C%5Csigma_i%5E2%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Csigma_i)%20-%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F458e8156145037ed3c15535c30f15394.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZpaUi%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7afa5e46" id="u7afa5e46"><span data-lake-id="udee371d0" id="udee371d0">在数据充分且模型容量足够大的条件下，最优的基于得分的模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2C%5C%5Csigma)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1caa26dd10fd11a5d67b2da01484d93b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lzGHP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua7b5899c" id="ua7b5899c">几乎处处都与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc902ec742ee0173f5ba9e162a00bb224.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22p0eNv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u14c3084e" id="u14c3084e">相匹配，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F73aca91ca00c37ec34e0dae6c932fac2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fjFR8%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud9b00355" id="ud9b00355"><span data-lake-id="u70ecf5db" id="u70ecf5db">在采样阶段，Song 与 Ermon（2019）针对每个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffcc3c4e71e71c8a4175f70c45c82955e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vWfOw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9f73a32e" id="u9f73a32e">，依次运行 M 步 Langevin MCMC，以获得相应样本，即</span></p><p data-lake-id="uff45c8d2" id="uff45c8d2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5Em%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5E%7Bm-1%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cepsilon_i%5C%5C%2C%20s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5E%7Bm-1%7D%2C%5C%5Csigma_i)%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B2%5C%5Cepsilon_i%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_i%5Em%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20m%3D1%2C2%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2CM%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc9e3357b9caff28e7b8a99f9865fa995.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CdHv3%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uec06f9b1" id="uec06f9b1"><span data-lake-id="u45f8929d" id="u45f8929d">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_i%3E0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F52e78dc5adf4525bce24ebcb4d9fd39b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nBfDt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufa33a83f" id="ufa33a83f">为步长，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_i%5Em%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F61ae7db06253d910cf915163a3ead8b2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PP2oH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufe73ebd4" id="ufe73ebd4">为标准高斯噪声。上述过程按照</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%3DN%2CN-1%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2C1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffd66601200660abda964cc1683e4f97c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vF3cv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u650d7961" id="u650d7961">的顺序依次执行，其中初始值满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_N%5E0%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%5E2%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F725582960560208163d1c357d3bb429c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ovmnb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u407da675" id="u407da675">并且当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%3CN%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb870ba1eb493b3f9b61038094c5c207d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YPW05%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue80fee53" id="ue80fee53">时，有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5E0%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi%2B1%7D%5EM%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2e9a59e1b79d28c355c1199f190849bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ppsES%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u587d0da7" id="u587d0da7">。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cinfty%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0af4c7c39f0d49146de0804b9d4739b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SZwsr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9934d889" id="u9934d889">且对所有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zxzqg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5f11152" id="ua5f11152">都有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_i%5C%5Cto%200%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe5cde0bbe44fe9db37b59074d0700d4e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lhZLn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua4629a27" id="ua4629a27">时，在一定正则条件下，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_1%5EM%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F52401f3ff3eab8f94292f2b4a0593310.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dz6Rl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7cc67938" id="u7cc67938">将成为来自</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Capprox%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ebc02005b5c88834f68daccc3a464b3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hmeD6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5ec97ad2" id="u5ec97ad2">的精确样本</span></p><card type="block" name="hr" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UKXYz%22%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u151ed2ee" id="u151ed2ee"><span data-lake-id="u11f0594d" id="u11f0594d">Sohl-Dickstein 等（2015）以及 Ho 等（2020）考虑一组正的噪声尺度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%220%3C%5C%5Cbeta_1%2C%5C%5Cbeta_2%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2C%5C%5Cbeta_N%3C1.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F64985572404ad4a03e2fb119fcea9e88.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J9S0Y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6998e6b3" id="u6998e6b3">对于每一个训练样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd297efcd01361e1e9cc6d369f9cd37df.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M6k24%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0102746e" id="u0102746e">，构造一个离散马尔可夫链</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_1%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_N%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F20a4c237884da0ed283b809ad3f93dc2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DuYQ7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uafbe3716" id="uafbe3716">使其满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi-1%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%3B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbeta_i%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%2C%5C%5Cbeta_i%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fab0e917eeae802e3be0bd1b11504cbe6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g3KOE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u23b07ef3" id="u23b07ef3">因此有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%3B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C(1-%5C%5Calpha_i)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F60542ef39f3d0d92cf799fcc91071c58.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t55fA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7bd608bb" id="u7bd608bb">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_i%3A%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5E%7Bi%7D(1-%5C%5Cbeta_j).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F244de9a10c1931e0f93c5d7bfabf61ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w75V9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9605d766" id="u9605d766">与 SMLD 类似，可将受扰动的数据分布记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5C%2Cp_%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2d7cfabb3529dcd465cfb450cece17f1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ib4aA%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u42b3be2a" id="u42b3be2a"><span data-lake-id="ua4726c0c" id="ua4726c0c">噪声尺度经过预先设定，使得</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2649b99fe56a3fd96cde660a5e95449d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xUKKT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0cc62caf" id="u0cc62caf">近似服从标准高斯分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4e9043c87b236866b1ef6c86e9743a3b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TyVW1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc4590736" id="uc4590736">。在反向方向上，一个变分马尔可夫链被参数化为</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue3f311be" id="ue3f311be" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbeta_i%7D%7D%5C%5Cbigl(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%2B%5C%5Cbeta_i%20s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%2Ci)%5C%5Cbigr)%2C%20%5C%5Cbeta_i%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7db1f2e3c77aad99bba39319f099b7d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lsSoO%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue2f29d3b" id="ue2f29d3b"><span data-lake-id="uab581ec7" id="uab581ec7">并通过证据下界（ELBO）的加权变体进行训练：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua07a89a9" id="ua07a89a9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%20%3D%20%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%20(1-%5C%5Calpha_i)%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%2Ci)%20-%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e5172b0d0470c2f811138bf3716d44a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FHNXm%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u4cbed6fd" id="u4cbed6fd"><span data-lake-id="ufd949b51" id="ufd949b51">在求解得到最优模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2Ci)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd41dc0a88f1719d4e60005743dec3dc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E5eiB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u05472731" id="u05472731">之后，可从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_N%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7484d10d61b862c917184d90a69da0de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P4czl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2ff8df96" id="u2ff8df96">出发，并按照如下估计得到的逆向马尔可夫链生成样本：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua3f94f9a" id="ua3f94f9a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbeta_i%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cbigl(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%2B%5C%5Cbeta_i%20s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%2Ci)%5C%5Cbigr)%20%2B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbeta_i%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_i%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20i%3DN%2CN-1%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2C1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F10cf7d60d1ba09e3b125ef6205c205fa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sqAaw%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u42176bdc" id="u42176bdc"><span data-lake-id="u55a2ad7f" id="u55a2ad7f">将这种方法称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0f1fbb00" id="u0f1fbb00">祖先采样</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u32406c6c" id="u32406c6c">（ancestral sampling），因为它等价于从图模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7Dp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2470b1667395e7258548903614929907.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aMyJJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3ed44cf8" id="u3ed44cf8">中执行祖先式采样。目标函数同样是若干去噪得分匹配目标的加权求和，这意味着最优模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%2Ci)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F933930f69405012d9306319563df582e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qUdDw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5a8c7bff" id="u5a8c7bff">将与受扰动数据分布的得分函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3d2016b620d1644ee605ee7cb445efcc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UXCGM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9d76310f" id="u9d76310f">相匹配。权重系数都与相应扰动核的函数形式有关，具体表现为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u607098d5" id="u607098d5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_i%5E2%20%5C%5Cpropto%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_i)%20%5C%5Cpropto%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb4b01b4f2bf402879354f9d440ed54a5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ScE40%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="uJEu0" id="uJEu0" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u922a21e9" id="u922a21e9">🦅</span><span data-lake-id="u6e02d9f5" id="u6e02d9f5"> 𝑺𝑪𝑶𝑹𝑬-𝑩𝑨𝑺𝑬𝑫 𝑮𝑬𝑵𝑬𝑹𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑽𝑬 𝑴𝑶𝑫𝑬𝑳𝑰𝑵𝑮 𝑾𝑰𝑻𝑯 𝑺𝑫𝑬𝑺</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u953a8cdb" id="u953a8cdb"><strong><span data-lake-id="u905b45ad" id="u905b45ad" style="color: #70000D">前述方法之所以能够取得良好生成效果，一个关键原因在于它们在多个噪声尺度下对数据进行扰动建模。基于这一观察，论文进一步将这一思想推广到连续情形，即引入无穷多个噪声尺度，使受扰动数据分布在噪声逐渐增强的过程中按照随机微分方程（SDE）连续演化</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u07c70253" id="u07c70253" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1774410893017-5cdeddcd-28e4-40d0-95fc-cb24534163f1.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u8109ca66-265d-48f5-8912-5194b436cba%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uc50bca4e-fd3a-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A746.6000366210938%2C%22height%22%3A259%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A325725%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1062%2C%22originHeight%22%3A369%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22x%22%3A687%2C%22y%22%3A228%2C%22width%22%3A292%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-G(T)VALOGP(W)DT%2BG(TD0-%22%2C%22x%22%3A702%2C%22y%22%3A40%2C%22width%22%3A282%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DC%3DF(C%2CTDT%E5%8D%81GTDU%22%2C%22x%22%3A194%2C%22y%22%3A41%2C%22width%22%3A191%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROBABILITYFLOWODE%22%2C%22x%22%3A221%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A182%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORWARDSDE%22%2C%22x%22%3A233%2C%22y%22%3A11%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REVERSESDE%22%2C%22x%22%3A735%2C%22y%22%3A12%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P0()%22%2C%22x%22%3A994%2C%22y%22%3A339%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80DA%3DF%2CT-G(T%22%2C%22x%22%3A561%2C%22y%22%3A40%2C%22width%22%3A193%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A512%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PT(%22%2C%22x%22%3A505%2C%22y%22%3A341%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P0(R%22%2C%22x%22%3A25%2C%22y%22%3A341%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P(2%22%2C%22x%22%3A754%2C%22y%22%3A341%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A602%2C%22y%22%3A186%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A65%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P(%22%2C%22x%22%3A260%2C%22y%22%3A341%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DATA%22%2C%22x%22%3A1007%2C%22y%22%3A13%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PRIOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A513%2C%22y%22%3A12%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DATA%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A13%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SDE%22%2C%22x%22%3A123%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%22%2C%22x%22%3A987%2C%22y%22%3A43%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A703%2C%22y%22%3A144%2C%22width%22%3A298%2C%22height%22%3A150%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A563%2C%22y%22%3A189%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ANW%22%2C%22x%22%3A759%2C%22y%22%3A151%2C%22width%22%3A120%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%2381cb59%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u73242c73%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ucc01776a" id="ucc01776a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u22957f6c" id="u22957f6c">论文的目标是构造一个由连续时间变量</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2CT%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa5cef51fad9b5deb42314ba69c08cadd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22b1Puw%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u13197e09" id="u13197e09">索引的扩散过程</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe7a153a93046d391203b2224daf7cc5d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PNLZT%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf193b71b" id="uf193b71b">，使其在初始时刻满足</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x(0)%5C%5Csim%20p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7ebbe5283b7f3cb37a3fbc774cc96a65.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UxDgW%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u99d531f0" id="u99d531f0">，其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x(0)%5C%5Csim%20p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7ebbe5283b7f3cb37a3fbc774cc96a65.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lBWuY%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u44445a1a" id="u44445a1a">为数据分布；在终止时刻满足</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x(T)%5C%5Csim%20p_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1761f8fd8980f368dd14572e3aa1f1f7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XSX9c%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6af2aace" id="u6af2aace">，其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F24d6cc09c36e59d28e8dd7b8855bbc8f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WyCVV%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0d255649" id="u0d255649">为易于采样的先验分布。换言之，该过程旨在将数据分布连续地扩散到一个可处理的先验分布。为此，论文使用 Itô 随机微分方程对该扩散过程进行建模：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ua9371ba1" id="ua9371ba1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22dx%3Df(x%2Ct)%5C%5C%2Cdt%2Bg(t)%5C%5C%2Cdw%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5a53f42beb0157640b58f0322468fb2d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22meYdd%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua54b0c44" id="ua54b0c44"><span data-lake-id="ub89d009e" id="ub89d009e">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc9b08ae6d9fed72562880f75720531bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dw19X%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u97b7dc8d" id="u97b7dc8d">为标准 Wiener 过程，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f(x%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffe7efa77409a8bb14c2616cf4828ff5e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Henhj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2cf5ef9f" id="u2cf5ef9f">为漂移项，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F44722b595d1bf03803323cda0fe6547b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qzKhp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u074a4d1a" id="u074a4d1a">为扩散系数。假设扩散系数为与状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FdKeH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4d7e8b4b" id="u4d7e8b4b">无关的标量函数，但这一设定可以自然推广到更一般的情形。在适当正则条件下，该 SDE 存在唯一强解。进一步地，论文记</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F09bd2c850203216a70dc493f1f7ecd6f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YVbcn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8525bf9f" id="u8525bf9f">为时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D4Qmx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u39389cad" id="u39389cad">的状态分布密度，并用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7Bst%7D(x(t)%5C%5Cmid%20x(s))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2c26219f93c8ad57539b6460fa7b9839.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dnxfc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u96ab10cc" id="u96ab10cc">表示从时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tpHCE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub8144c81" id="ub8144c81">到时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hy9xF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u66d58901" id="u66d58901">的转移核。在具体建模中，终态分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F24d6cc09c36e59d28e8dd7b8855bbc8f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OiRDj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u873bf42b" id="u873bf42b">通常被设定为不包含数据结构信息、但便于高效采样的简单先验分布，例如均值和方差固定的高斯分布。围绕这一目标，可以设计不同形式的 SDE，使数据分布在连续扩散过程中逐步演化为给定先验分布</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1b75b016" id="u1b75b016"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub6aa271f" id="ub6aa271f">Anderson（1982）的一个重要结论指出：扩散过程的时间反演仍然是一个扩散过程，其动力学由如下逆时间随机微分方程给出：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u53fda684" id="u53fda684" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbigl%5B%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2Ct)-g(t)%5E2%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Cbigr%5Ddt%20%2B%20g(t)%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%7D%2C%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3ffc53109233f7ed0f0f9790ba76d800.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22V7ShH%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u67dc5627" id="u67dc5627"><span data-lake-id="u59c2235b" id="u59c2235b">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F59477d3562bf5bf81bd381026b2a8e92.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LSY9S%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0584a583" id="u0584a583">表示当时间从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qEyxD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9d891c52" id="u9d891c52">向</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%220%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22d0feea96d3bb2fc273f7598ce748c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KJiw4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua89fd360" id="ua89fd360">反向流动时对应的标准 Wiener 过程，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22dt%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc87b00cbe5df5ac75db3b433ea04afe3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kBkVw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5ac6c30" id="ua5ac6c30">则表示一个无穷小的负时间步长。只要能够获得任意时刻边缘分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa8de2ddcc1904ed29c1b98d67f7230dc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pLjmC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue9f90711" id="ue9f90711">的得分函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F87122859bf252b2eee17ea2c93669b2b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xYDD3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc914dc99" id="uc914dc99">便可以由构造出对应的逆扩散过程，并通过数值模拟该逆过程，从先验分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F24d6cc09c36e59d28e8dd7b8855bbc8f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ncZyC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1a294a23" id="u1a294a23">逐步生成服从数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5940a3acff4f38f793a8ce19bdb8690.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oivL7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0f8d6569" id="u0f8d6569">的样本</span></p><p data-lake-id="u42485ffe" id="u42485ffe"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub01894fc" id="ub01894fc">分布的得分函数可以通过在样本上训练基于得分的模型，并采用 score matching 方法进行估计。为估计</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F87122859bf252b2eee17ea2c93669b2b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YYF2W%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2f04389f" id="u2f04389f">论文训练一个时间相关的得分模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2Ct)%EF%BC%8C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc303ca588d9e01d5beb99ed30e3e8dd0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22agS6A%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4d5cb0e2" id="u4d5cb0e2">其目标函数可以看作对 SMLD 和 DDPM 的连续时间推广：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u946ccef8" id="u946ccef8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%20%3D%20%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7B%20%5C%5Clambda(t)%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%2Ct)%20-%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0))%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D.%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe8016d4d8327a2d6871d5f0453bf9fac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KSpXM%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u98bda7ac" id="u98bda7ac"><span data-lake-id="u1e8b2390" id="u1e8b2390">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%3A%5B0%2CT%5D%5C%5Cto%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D_%7B%3E0%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcc392d5d2e0435b6260526f92b562ca3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VVgWU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u37a69703" id="u37a69703">为正的加权函数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CvR1R%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u764583fa" id="u764583fa">在区间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B0%2CT%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc25ba8fb85e607822ca599e1fe042c87.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r1Thw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2435541c" id="u2435541c">上均匀采样，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)%5C%5Csim%20p_0(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F678d5e6e33db9aa7f3a2c20212458501.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vKfgg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u09c9fca7" id="u09c9fca7">，且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcce90351416eee742bd7022ada233334.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22suxf4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucac9a65a" id="ucac9a65a">。在数据充足且模型容量足够大的条件下，score matching 保证最优解</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4752fb614dee98a6bd4a4eec9200b8ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22W3phf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud266185e" id="ud266185e">在几乎所有的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2adf48e1cf80858f0604d2b51eeed4b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C3PZs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u13b54bb9" id="u13b54bb9">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yAGfG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2236f5d8" id="u2236f5d8">上都等于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd23cb10d7f8322bd7a863a6dd5a0c6ae.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GHOQz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua1d16a8f" id="ua1d16a8f">与 SMLD 和 DDPM 类似，通常可以取</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud1c3af92" id="ud1c3af92" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda(t)%5C%5Cpropto%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0))%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5C%5Cright%5D%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F219a2776868dc2678bee2fc84dd61071.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P7rsX%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u39d3d46e" id="u39d3d46e"><span data-lake-id="u3b39e167" id="u3b39e167">采用的是去噪 score matching，但其他形式的 score matching 目标，如 sliced score matching 和 finite-difference score matching 同样适用</span></p><p data-lake-id="u181b3839" id="u181b3839"><strong><span data-lake-id="ueec1a86d" id="ueec1a86d" style="color: #101E60">为高效求解，通常需要已知转移核</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F103537bf3d7102b2530753969974a21b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uzeO7%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u71c2efae" id="u71c2efae" style="color: #101E60">当</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f(%5C%5Ccdot%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F961626b2bb3a3f83ee86a011df07bcad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22waDaf%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u072c8116" id="u072c8116" style="color: #101E60">为仿射函数时，该转移核总是高斯分布，其均值和方差通常具有闭式表达，因此可以利用标准方法直接求得</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u24768803" id="u24768803">。对于更一般的 SDE，论文指出，也可以通过求解 Kolmogorov 前向方程来获得</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0c1be9ecbf275b7802d3c107cb53d19e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FLEjS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3f9d6ca0" id="u3f9d6ca0">。另一种可行方案是直接模拟 SDE，从条件分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0c1be9ecbf275b7802d3c107cb53d19e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zeRq0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u03069c0d" id="u03069c0d">中采样，并在训练时用 sliced score matching 替代去噪 score matching，从而绕开对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F719834a16e9f3528d5439226f20f1de5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MZXE6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua87d730b" id="ua87d730b">的显式计算</span></p><p data-lake-id="ucd7e3920" id="ucd7e3920"><strong><span data-lake-id="uaf55a865" id="uaf55a865">SMLD 与 DDPM 中使用的噪声扰动，都可以看作是两类不同随机微分方程（SDE）的离散化形式。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc6140213" id="uc6140213">对于 SMLD，当采用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TGPKY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6f3901f9" id="u6f3901f9">个噪声尺度时，每个扰动核</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0d6aefb82d96cf310e8525b377938809.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mPq3a%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u593b7921" id="u593b7921">都对应于如下马尔可夫链中变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffacb4d282568f25626d22799a25b3896.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DeP5J%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7875668c" id="u7875668c">的分布：</span></p><p data-lake-id="udce3c5f4" id="udce3c5f4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%5E2-%5C%5Csigma_%7Bi-1%7D%5E2%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20i%3D1%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2CN%2C%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fac1dc653af6ac2f986123c79200293a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22loFBP%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u02de2558" id="u02de2558"><span data-lake-id="udb61f8a7" id="udb61f8a7">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9edecbe3eeb9d41fece2c1f5540b1a06.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cFlIn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u985b32e9" id="u985b32e9">。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cinfty%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8383b3c56bec3d8fe2a5252225a1628b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Vkrls%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3e82b815" id="u3e82b815">时，若</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_i%5E2%3Di%2FN%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff66c9b2d0d972b983477eeefc45d5028.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tUSOx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u88a7347a" id="u88a7347a">，则</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe1fd3b51c51946cb3262f68bdd1e4ff6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BFtjd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud5c02af8" id="ud5c02af8">变为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf52d701ecffcd4192ff93163a7d8607.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aoUBN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua42347f4" id="ua42347f4">，离散马尔可夫链</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0cc71851477404413a1d3e713d965689.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hVgCM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0ec621d5" id="u0ec621d5">收敛为连续随机过程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bx(t)%5C%5C%7D_%7Bt%3D0%7D%5E%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8795c6801b8dc473599dd3b94e8fa8d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WoiHI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u061f6dff" id="u061f6dff">，其对应的 SDE 为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u50bd1916" id="u50bd1916" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%5B%5C%5Csigma%5E2(t)%5D%7D%7Bdt%7D%7D%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F41e43179c74a6271d32071141d59807b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aOZ6m%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua05d4729" id="ua05d4729"><span data-lake-id="u0da8dc00" id="u0da8dc00">类似地，对于 DDPM 的扰动核</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbd2cab7720d55c86142efc7f0d2c566a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rxkUK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udb747c4b" id="udb747c4b">，其离散马尔可夫链写为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u8cd7b8a8" id="u8cd7b8a8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbeta_i%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbeta_i%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20i%3D1%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2CN.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fddea6e3c8ebac34c4d6559852c8fc2db.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z9iwj%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u9c595009" id="u9c595009"><span data-lake-id="u09ef622a" id="u09ef622a">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cinfty%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8383b3c56bec3d8fe2a5252225a1628b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OtCGG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u77d10aff" id="u77d10aff">时，收敛到如下 SDE：</span></p><p data-lake-id="uee2a4e88" id="uee2a4e88" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Cbeta(t)%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5C%5C%2Cdt%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbeta(t)%7D%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D.%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2da37b104b73ab045b377cbc44a132c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DNr9v%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua19a4f0c" id="ua19a4f0c"><span data-lake-id="u446d2841" id="u446d2841">因此，SMLD 与 DDPM 所采用的噪声扰动过程，本质上分别对应于两类 SDE 的离散近似。进一步地，论文指出，SMLD 所对应的过程在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cinfty%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe70bf88f6c2ff9e0ad7a2462bcd5a359.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GF3B7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u73463894" id="u73463894">时方差会不断增大，因此称其为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u307ed063" id="u307ed063">方差爆炸型 SDE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub983bf7f" id="ub983bf7f">（Variance Exploding, VE SDE）；而 DDPM 在初始分布具有单位方差时，会诱导一个始终保持固定方差的过程，因此称其为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7f83986c" id="u7f83986c">方差保持型 SDE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u40638e81" id="u40638e81">（Variance Preserving, VP SDE）。受 VP SDE 的启发，论文进一步提出一类在似然建模中表现更优的新型 SDE：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u92483f47" id="u92483f47" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Cbeta(t)%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5C%5C%2Cdt%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbeta(t)%5C%5CBigl(1-e%5E%7B-2%5C%5Cint_0%5Et%5C%5Cbeta(s)%5C%5C%2Cds%7D%5C%5CBigr)%7D%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D.%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F09158f5c2ac5ca41aca0c3e7e931ec6e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Vd5Ka%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u98feb88e" id="u98feb88e"><span data-lake-id="u3f1946fb" id="u3f1946fb">在使用相同</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb97f1ce3deb020e5c64f6db7cb24cc70.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x69DW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u696ced13" id="u696ced13">且从相同初始分布出发的条件下，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2bdb0de0" id="u2bdb0de0" style="color: #2A4200">所诱导随机过程的方差在任意中间时刻都被 VP SDE 对应的方差上界所约束</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u50ffe92a" id="u50ffe92a">。基于这一性质，论文称为 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4a10e4cd" id="u4a10e4cd">sub-VP SDE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u27fd4140" id="u27fd4140">。最后，由于 VE、VP 与 sub-VP 三类 SDE 的漂移项都属于仿射形式，其扰动核</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B0t%7D(x(t)%5C%5Cmid%20x(0))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9b73cc3ff071a09f1201db4a14cf22e4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XWfkt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u36311a32" id="u36311a32">均可写成高斯分布，并能够以闭式形式求得，这使得基于连续时间 score matching 训练可以高效实现</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1c37ac52" id="u1c37ac52" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0))%20%3D%20%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)%2C%20%5B%5C%5Csigma%5E2(t)%20-%20%5C%5Csigma%5E2(0)%5D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7B(VE%20SDE)%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)e%5E%7B-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Cint_0%5Et%20%5C%5Cbeta(s)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Ds%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7De%5E%7B-%5C%5Cint_0%5Et%20%5C%5Cbeta(s)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Ds%7D)%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7B(VP%20SDE)%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)e%5E%7B-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Cint_0%5Et%20%5C%5Cbeta(s)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Ds%7D%2C%20%5B1%20-%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Cint_0%5Et%20%5C%5Cbeta(s)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Ds%7D%5D%5E2%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7B(sub-VP%20SDE)%7D%20%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde2de96b04414eed8925d4fe1b42998e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i4zlL%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue31cc9d2" id="ue31cc9d2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6b52782e" id="u6b52782e">SMLD 与 DDPM 中使用的噪声扰动过程，分别对应于 VE SDE 与 VP SDE 的离散化形式</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua7cd76eb" id="ua7cd76eb">。VE SDE 在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cinfty%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe70bf88f6c2ff9e0ad7a2462bcd5a359.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22n4cJh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u97943371" id="u97943371">时会诱导一个方差持续增大的随机过程；与之相对，VP SDE 则对应一个方差始终有界的过程。进一步地，当初始分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd6d7866e90a91b2ed062627904d0b128.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22falAZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u37225c8c" id="u37225c8c">具有单位方差时，VP SDE 在所有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C%5C%5Cinfty)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9b58b510a9e7af703c72c5737dce8c5d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22omMvW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u52813662" id="u52813662">上都保持单位方差不变。由于 VP SDE 的漂移项与扩散项均为仿射形式，论文借助 Särkkä 与 Solin 中的结果，得到其协方差随时间演化所满足的常微分方程：</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc0334b8b" id="uc0334b8b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(t)%7D%7Bdt%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbeta(t)%5C%5Cbigl(I-%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(t)%5C%5Cbigr)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5a9eee4909d5277a0146396f8f062a72.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nLEHg%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf52208f3" id="uf52208f3"><span data-lake-id="u635f664a" id="u635f664a">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(t)%3A%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCov%7D%5Bx(t)%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F06115ea77f52d26f4afbed9849f40c15.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wkmNF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u77a6ea34" id="u77a6ea34">表示满足 VP SDE 的随机过程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bx(t)%5C%5C%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Cge%200%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F019900674d87539688ebae1432484d3e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cvGdY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5a38c673" id="u5a38c673">在时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LqzYG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u17ea2b7c" id="u17ea2b7c">的协方差矩阵。对该方程求解可得</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue7ae6fb8" id="ue7ae6fb8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(t)%20%3D%20I%2Be%5E%7B-%5C%5Cint_0%5Et%20%5C%5Cbeta(s)%5C%5C%2Cds%7D%5C%5Cbigl(%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(0)-I%5C%5Cbigr).%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fae46ef5a2f3d3ba7e857fb820c786b0e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ih1k4%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua99bb348" id="ua99bb348"><span data-lake-id="u3e1bc742" id="u3e1bc742">只要初始协方差</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f2ddee39484a218242336c63cf37cce.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FsJV7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u38a6c08e" id="u38a6c08e">有界，则任意时刻的协方差</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8f423c1acbe750769b8760a9cb202528.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UFm1i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9f6b9068" id="u9f6b9068">也始终保持有界；特别地，当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(0)%3DI%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F144ff5aa91fd3f067559554083f39a76.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E0uZH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5d0731b" id="ua5d0731b">时，有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(t)%5C%5Cequiv%20I.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38fd883f93042032fdb3c840df0dae3c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WGU0g%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud6ab0e7e" id="ud6ab0e7e">即该过程在整个演化过程中始终保持单位方差。正是基于这一性质差异，论文将 DDPM 对应的过程称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5e487212" id="u5e487212">方差保持型随机微分方程 VP SDE</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="BjnWl" id="BjnWl" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u72143414" id="u72143414">🐇</span><span data-lake-id="ua843ea46" id="ua843ea46"> 𝑺𝑶𝑳𝑽𝑰𝑵𝑮 𝑻𝑯𝑬 𝑹𝑬𝑽𝑬𝑹𝑺𝑬 𝑺𝑫𝑬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub9d9af9b" id="ub9d9af9b"><span data-lake-id="u5b4fb82e" id="u5b4fb82e">在训练得到时间相关的得分模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2d55c58894df1f5539f1ad602b839b3e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GcqGJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc1ff73ae" id="uc1ff73ae">之后，便可以利用该模型构造逆时间 SDE，并通过数值方法对其进行模拟，从而生成服从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5940a3acff4f38f793a8ce19bdb8690.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OGTLU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaf073c79" id="uaf073c79">的样本。由于 SDE 的解析解通常难以直接获得，因此实际生成过程依赖于数值求解器对随机动力学轨迹进行近似。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u75812a64" id="u75812a64">已有大量通用的 SDE 数值求解方法，例如 Euler–Maruyama 方法和随机 Runge–Kutta 方法等，它们本质上对应于对随机动力学过程的不同离散化方式。因此，这些通用数值方法都可以直接应用于逆时间 SDE 的采样过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucd826ae6" id="ucd826ae6">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0f9a1fd7" id="u0f9a1fd7"><span data-lake-id="uafe0ab3e" id="uafe0ab3e">进一步地，论文指出，DDPM 中使用的祖先采样实际上可以看作逆时间 VP SDE 的一种特殊离散化形式。然而，对于新的 SDE，直接推导其对应的祖先采样规则往往并不容易。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucfcb6d8c" id="ucfcb6d8c">为解决这一问题，论文提出逆扩散采样器：其核心思想是在离散化逆时间 SDE 时，采用与前向过程相同的离散化方式，从而可以在已知前向离散形式的基础上直接构造出对应的逆向采样规则</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc5b1124a" id="uc5b1124a"><span data-lake-id="u903ca96d" id="u903ca96d">由于已经获得基于得分的模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2Ct)%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd123aafea90e65edb8656daaf2241cc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RrXVD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u659ae2e0" id="u659ae2e0">因此可以进一步引入基于得分的 MCMC 方法，例如 Langevin MCMC 或 HMC，直接对各时刻的边缘分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3dc94096f0c327b693e084140d512d2f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x7eGO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9c621507" id="u9c621507">进行采样，并据此对数值 SDE 求解器给出的结果进行校正</span></p><p data-lake-id="u940c4a9d" id="u940c4a9d"><span data-lake-id="ucc0b8426" id="ucc0b8426">具体来说，在每一个时间步，数值 SDE 求解器首先给出下一时刻样本的估计，这一过程起到预测器（predictor）的作用；随后，基于得分的 MCMC 方法对该估计样本的边缘分布进行修正，从而起到校正器（corrector）的作用。这一思想与求解方程组时常用的预测器—校正器方法相类似，因此论文将这种混合采样算法称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufcfbfa09" id="ufcfbfa09">预测器—校正器（Predictor-Corrector, PC）采样器</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u503c233d" id="u503c233d">。从更一般的角度看，PC 采样器实际上统一并推广 SMLD 与 DDPM 的原始采样方式：对于前者，预测器可以看作恒等映射，而校正器对应于退火 Langevin 动力学；对于后者，预测器对应祖先采样，而校正器则退化为恒等映射</span></p><p data-lake-id="u374c182a" id="u374c182a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1774435267347-46ee3b74-914e-4957-a5d8-87710fef32c4.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u10d6399a-c350-4567-97a9-e8b6f24b8ea%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uc6975079-55fa-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A844.2000122070312%2C%22height%22%3A263%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A92353%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1109%2C%22originHeight%22%3A346%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3AX-XI%2B1%E5%8D%81(0.%2B1-0.)S0*(XI%2B1%2C0I%2B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A464%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X-(2-V1-BI%2B1)XI%2B1%E5%8D%81B%2B1S0*(XI%2B1%2C0%22%2C%22x%22%3A585%2C%22y%22%3A121%2C%22width%22%3A473%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALGORITHM3PCSAMPLING(VPSDE)%22%2C%22x%22%3A549%2C%22y%22%3A11%2C%22width%22%3A414%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALGORITHM2PCSAMPLING(VESDE)%22%2C%22x%22%3A12%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A409%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%3AFORI%3DW-1TO0D0%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A88%2C%22width%22%3A271%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22XI-XI%E5%8D%8110-1-08%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A180%2C%22width%22%3A283%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%226%3AFORI%3D1TOMD0%22%2C%22x%22%3A10%2C%22y%22%3A214%2C%22width%22%3A251%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22I%E5%8D%816ISO%E7%B1%B3(XI%2CI)%E5%8D%81V26IZ%22%2C%22x%22%3A698%2C%22y%22%3A271%2C%22width%22%3A269%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%3AXN~N(0%2C0AI)%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A239%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%3AFORI%3DN-1T0%22%2C%22x%22%3A559%2C%22y%22%3A85%2C%22width%22%3A216%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORJ%3D1TOMDO%22%2C%22x%22%3A591%2C%22y%22%3A214%2C%22width%22%3A216%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22XI-X%2BBI%2B1Z%22%2C%22x%22%3A591%2C%22y%22%3A187%2C%22width%22%3A220%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Z~N(0%2CI%22%2C%22x%22%3A591%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A155%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%229%3ARETURNXO%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A136%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%3AXN~W(0%2CI)%22%2C%22x%22%3A559%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A192%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22XI%E5%8D%81EISG*XI%2C0I)%E5%8D%81V26IZ%22%2C%22x%22%3A143%2C%22y%22%3A276%2C%22width%22%3A298%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Z~(0I)%22%2C%22x%22%3A63%2C%22y%22%3A242%2C%22width%22%3A163%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%229%3ARETURNXO%22%2C%22x%22%3A557%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A137%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Z~V(0%2CI)%22%2C%22x%22%3A616%2C%22y%22%3A243%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Z~V(OI%22%2C%22x%22%3A54%2C%22y%22%3A143%2C%22width%22%3A211%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PREDICTOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A974%2C%22y%22%3A180%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORRECTOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A974%2C%22y%22%3A226%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S%22%2C%22x%22%3A558%2C%22y%22%3A213%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A54%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22XI-XI%E5%8D%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A75%2C%22y%22%3A272%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A17%2C%22y%22%3A99%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A46%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22XI-XI%E5%8D%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A626%2C%22y%22%3A273%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%225%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A559%2C%22y%22%3A187%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%227%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A14%2C%22y%22%3A241%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A558%2C%22y%22%3A157%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%225%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A14%2C%22y%22%3A179%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A550%2C%22y%22%3A119%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%E4%B8%80(2%22%2C%22x%22%3A589%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%228%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A15%2C%22y%22%3A264%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S%22%2C%22x%22%3A558%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A48%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A16%2C%22y%22%3A138%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f3d9c7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uc00b26d9%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="udaee48f2" id="udaee48f2"><span data-lake-id="u10023845" id="u10023845">基于得分的模型还提供另一种求解逆时间 SDE 的数值途径。对于任意扩散过程，都存在一个与之对应的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7be6d048" id="u7be6d048">确定性过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uaa65b2c6" id="uaa65b2c6">，其轨迹虽然不再具有随机性，但在各个时刻仍与原 SDE 共享相同的边缘概率密度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bp_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5C%7D_%7Bt%3D0%7D%5E%7BT%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48cb2e592a383f90cee0a066f727213f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WDqP8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5236cc56" id="u5236cc56">。这一确定性过程满足如下常微分方程：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u19dc1256" id="u19dc1256" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2Ct)-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7Dg(t)%5E2%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Cright%5Ddt%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f2bc90f3a22def6a89b045976273a1b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a0z4I%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u39468564" id="u39468564"><span data-lake-id="u3120015c" id="u3120015c">该方程在已知得分函数后即可由原始 SDE 唯一确定。论文称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u51beeddb" id="u51beeddb">概率流常微分方程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4874dee7" id="u4874dee7">（probability flow ODE）。当其中的得分函数由时间相关的得分模型近似，而该模型通常取为神经网络时，这一过程便构成神经 ODE 的一个具体实例</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua3d05748" id="ua3d05748"><span data-lake-id="u681737e8" id="u681737e8">在此基础上，论文进一步指出，借助神经 ODE 中的瞬时变量替换公式，可以上式所定义的密度进行显式计算，从而实现对任意输入数据的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u54dbfca3" id="u54dbfca3">精确似然估计。 </span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0faa0485" id="u0faa0485">除似然计算外，概率流 ODE 还使得潜在表示操控成为可能。通过上式进行积分，可以将任意数据点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F78d67808d26460f72d0fce0fc113a5fb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XDUmr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u09381591" id="u09381591">编码到潜空间中的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(T)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffbd71df201f40217ffdb20317430c28b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bhdjP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1a291412" id="u1a291412">；相应地，再对对应的逆时间 ODE 进行积分，则可以完成解码过程。与其他可逆模型，如神经 ODE 与正规化流类似，这种机制使得模型能够对潜在表示进行操作，从而支持图像插值、温度缩放以及更一般的图像编辑任务</span></p><p data-lake-id="u586c23b4" id="u586c23b4"><span data-lake-id="ua792cbb1" id="ua792cbb1">更进一步地，论文强调，该编码过程具有</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7e2764d8" id="u7e2764d8">唯一可识别性</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud9a748ab" id="ud9a748ab">。不同于多数现有可逆模型，这里的编码在数据充分、模型容量足够且优化充分的条件下，是由数据分布唯一确定的。其原因在于：前向 SDE 本身不含可训练参数，而与之对应的概率流 ODE 在得分函数估计准确时会给出与其一致的轨迹，因此编码映射并不会因参数化自由度而产生额外歧义</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5e5b718e" id="u5e5b718e"><span data-lake-id="ucd29c08f" id="ucd29c08f">最后，在采样方面，论文表明也可以通过求解上市从不同的终态条件</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(T)%5C%5Csim%20p_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff12bb31c9db5d1237a8c9a0de2dfbf49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IkPs4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub114f37f" id="ub114f37f">出发生成</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)%5C%5Csim%20p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4b3693506d0fade8978652360fbbb305.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HnB9L%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3e3c00b1" id="u3e3c00b1">的样本。采用固定离散化策略时，概率流 ODE 已能够生成具有竞争力的样本，尤其是在与校正器结合使用时效果更佳。若进一步采用黑盒 ODE 求解器，则不仅能够生成高质量样本，还能够显式控制采样精度与计算效率之间的权衡</span></p><p data-lake-id="u683a1329" id="u683a1329"><span data-lake-id="u9ca05060" id="u9ca05060">该框架的连续时间结构不仅能够用于从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5940a3acff4f38f793a8ce19bdb8690.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a0xGf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4fc5a791" id="u4fc5a791">中生成数据样本，还能够在已知</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(y%5C%5Cmid%20x(t))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc67a17ef94bfffb868c00bf387c40663.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NH549%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud8e46615" id="ud8e46615">的条件下，从条件分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0(x(0)%5C%5Cmid%20y)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe735b939c6b53e54bd20a4a7886fcccc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ch3Tq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u28c0cab4" id="u28c0cab4">中进行采样。具体而言，给定前向 SDE，可以从终态条件分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_T(x(T)%5C%5Cmid%20y)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fef0d3df844268cfe14f571919da01c49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22liOit%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua4c41e5a" id="ua4c41e5a">出发，通过求解如下</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9e3b7a3c" id="u9e3b7a3c">条件逆时间 SDE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3bd47c57" id="u3bd47c57"> 来获得</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x(t)%5C%5Cmid%20y)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3ae75d70e5a7e6822e862a0b974c8111.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iTRtx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaeb74709" id="uaeb74709">的样本：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9d09c233" id="u9d09c233" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5CBigl%5C%5C%7B%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2Ct)%20-%20g(t)%5E2%20%5C%5Cbigl%5B%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_t(y%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Cbigr%5D%20%5C%5CBigr%5C%5C%7Ddt%20%2B%20g(t)%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7dbec828a776527048f224438f9aa3d8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rhbj5%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ucbcfa258" id="ucbcfa258"><span data-lake-id="u0325b683" id="u0325b683">一般而言，只要能够获得前向观测过程梯度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_t(y%5C%5Cmid%20x(t))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Febc8efbb1e52c53fc7d9972fb1219dae.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lV0J9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u08ed81c8" id="u08ed81c8">的估计，便可以利用上市将基于得分的生成模型应用于一大类逆问题。在某些情形下，可以通过额外训练一个独立模型来学习</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20p_t(y%5C%5Cmid%20x(t))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbd0e54e48e27fc2560671d7ce0ed9991.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mYZ2E%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u78375ee1" id="u78375ee1">并进一步计算其梯度；而在其他情况下，也可以结合启发式策略与领域知识对该梯度进行近似估计</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="GWWzi" id="GWWzi" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ue6c6c2fc" id="ue6c6c2fc">🍄</span><span data-lake-id="u37953c33" id="u37953c33"> 𝑺𝑫𝑬𝒔 𝑰𝑵 𝑻𝑯𝑬 𝑾𝑰𝑳𝑫</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ue7fdfa70" id="ue7fdfa70"><strong><span data-lake-id="u171d8946" id="u171d8946" style="color: #70000D">VE SDE、VP SDE 与 sub-VP SDE 的具体实例化形式，说明它们如何分别对应 SMLD、DDPM 及论文实验中使用的 sub-VP 模型</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u533fe113" id="u533fe113"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc1e06d68" id="uc1e06d68">对于 SMLD，噪声尺度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EN%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1fac6020f5154659e692f0e7c8fa682e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nPiNP%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8be6f3c9" id="u8be6f3c9">通常取为几何序列，连续极限下有</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ua4f32267" id="ua4f32267" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(t)%3D%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Et%2C%5C%5Cquad%20t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7390bdfc1c98d8966b06f4b589f1a41e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a2nem%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u9890b8bc"><li fid="ud4e0271f" data-lake-id="u657c4f4e" id="u657c4f4e"><span data-lake-id="u638cffda" id="u638cffda">对应的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u17b3345b" id="u17b3345b">VE SDE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud0d9c7a9" id="ud0d9c7a9"> 为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud908f420" id="ud908f420" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22dx%3D%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Et%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B2%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D%7D%5C%5C%2Cdw%2C%5C%5Cquad%20t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1%5D%2C%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22082d05e2a5cf35e2b278421f3ce113.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RW6Ev%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u5fea8856"><li fid="uef65a1f8" data-lake-id="ue2187b09" id="ue2187b09"><span data-lake-id="u4ea72279" id="u4ea72279">其扰动核为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u09e5e64a" id="u09e5e64a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B0t%7D(x(t)%5C%5Cmid%20x(0))%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20x(t)%3Bx(0)%2C%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%5E2%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B2t%7DI%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5Cquad%20t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D.%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F77c9acffc4bb47b44dee437740ba36ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jB99u%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u492d82d7"><li fid="u7b2e0a44" data-lake-id="uc0dc701e" id="uc0dc701e"><span data-lake-id="u4e103deb" id="u4e103deb">由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf76c4580adc6af67436e1cd68eed17d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rzcLo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb1446d9" id="ucb1446d9">处存在不可导的细节问题，实际计算中通常将时间区间限制为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cepsilon%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d94cfe88334fb95da9713fe1cc61dee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wgDJI%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub7e86b63" id="ub7e86b63"><strong><span data-lake-id="u36cee1ea" id="u36cee1ea">对于 DDPM，离散噪声参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cbeta_i%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc68033e4ced83b575b98e5409a2b2a3a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WDj3X%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ude426704" id="ude426704">通常取为等差序列。在连续极限下</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u0b55fe7e" id="u0b55fe7e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta(t)%3D%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%2Bt(%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8346a112a75f587723cb7224878d31d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LRxWk%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua2bc3a30"><li fid="uc78af4bf" data-lake-id="ua73a7b75" id="ua73a7b75"><span data-lake-id="u15c01865" id="u15c01865">由此得到具体的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u47f9eaa6" id="u47f9eaa6">VP SDE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u031d496f" id="u031d496f">：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ucfed2958" id="ucfed2958" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22dx%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cfrac12%5C%5Cbigl(%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%2Bt(%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)%5C%5Cbigr)x%5C%5C%2Cdt%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%2Bt(%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)%7D%5C%5C%2Cdw%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F35af70d7b551e1bf5a1710fad424155a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nfqfb%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u30de85ab"><li fid="uc1728ca0" data-lake-id="u192e5322" id="u192e5322"><span data-lake-id="uae368d9d" id="uae368d9d">其扰动核为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u05c34e7a" id="u05c34e7a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B0t%7D(x(t)%5C%5Cmid%20x(0))%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20x(t)%3B%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Cfrac14%20t%5E2(%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)-%5C%5Cfrac12%20t%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7Dx(0)%2C%5C%5C%2C%20I-Ie%5E%7B-%5C%5Cfrac12%20t%5E2(%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)-t%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F227a5996e2013c72e03f2cbc8aa0d756.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LjAxV%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u0729777f"><li fid="u3812b7a1" data-lake-id="u70e2bed1" id="u70e2bed1"><span data-lake-id="ufd47542b" id="ufd47542b">VP SDE 本身没有 VE SDE 那样的间断问题，但由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cto0%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1421f18e4fca4eba21638666ea4c7559.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vYQ2h%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u33d5046a" id="u33d5046a">时方差趋近于 0，训练和采样时同样会将时间限制在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cepsilon%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d94cfe88334fb95da9713fe1cc61dee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C45in%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u33eaf4c8" id="u33eaf4c8"><strong><span data-lake-id="ube201744" id="ube201744">对于 sub-VP SDE，论文采用与 VP SDE 相同的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb97f1ce3deb020e5c64f6db7cb24cc70.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CqFcp%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9011401b" id="u9011401b">，它与 VP SDE 具有相同的均值衰减形式，但方差更受控制，因此通常在似然建模和样本质量上都更有优势。其扰动核进一步改写为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u14b2bbfe" id="u14b2bbfe" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B0t%7D(x(t)%5C%5Cmid%20x(0))%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20x(t)%3B%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Cfrac14%20t%5E2(%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)-%5C%5Cfrac12%20t%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7Dx(0)%2C%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%201-e%5E%7B-%5C%5Cfrac12%20t%5E2(%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)-t%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%5E2%20I%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5Cquad%20t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D.%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F61c8ba4ffc5a7314056a01eccb5d8a2c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RLJlK%22%7D"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="rjvzt" id="rjvzt" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u07325f70" id="u07325f70">🐎</span><span data-lake-id="u167924c6" id="u167924c6"> 𝐄𝐥𝐮𝐜𝐢𝐝𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐃𝐞𝐬𝐢𝐠𝐧 𝐒𝐩𝐚𝐜𝐞 𝐨𝐟 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧-𝐁𝐚𝐬𝐞𝐝 𝐆𝐞𝐧𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u6041ee46" id="u6041ee46"><strong><span data-lake-id="uacd4d5c2" id="uacd4d5c2">作者认为当前扩散生成模型的理论体系与实践方法在相当程度上被不必要地复杂化。为改善这一状况，论文提出一个能够清晰区分各类具体设计选择的统一设计空间。在这一框架下，作者识别并提出若干针对采样过程、训练过程以及 score 网络预条件化的改进策略</span></strong></p><ul list="ud2da5ea0"><li fid="ubea8c6c7" data-lake-id="u64bd3419" id="u64bd3419"><span data-lake-id="u972c1d25" id="u972c1d25">与先前方法相比，仅需</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7a0a8607" id="u7a0a8607">每张图像 35 次网络评估</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua380a732" id="ua380a732">即可完成采样，生成速度显著提升</span></li><li fid="ubea8c6c7" data-lake-id="u11b3307d" id="u11b3307d"><span data-lake-id="u2015f976" id="u2015f976">即使对于既有工作中已训练好的 score 网络，论文提出的设计调整同样能够显著提升其生成效率与图像质量</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u390e4712" id="u390e4712"><span data-lake-id="u2103b298" id="u2103b298">如何进一步改进扩散模型，使其在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1c5e996c" id="u1c5e996c">图像质量、分布拟合质量、训练成本</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc3500543" id="uc3500543">以及</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8f9e040a" id="u8f9e040a">生成速度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud0eda171" id="ud0eda171">等方面取得更优表现，已成为当前研究中的核心问题。现有关于扩散模型的文献在理论层面极为密集，其关于采样日程、训练动力学、噪声水平参数化等内容的推导，通常都尽可能直接地建立在严密的理论框架之上。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u11dc22ca" id="u11dc22ca" style="color: #DF2A3F">这种做法固然保证模型具有扎实的理论基础，但也可能带来一个问题：模型的可设计空间被遮蔽</span></strong></p><ul list="u057e8d4e"><li fid="u37f40dd8" data-lake-id="ua13fffbc" id="ua13fffbc"><span data-lake-id="u52ad66f3" id="u52ad66f3">论文从实践而非纯理论视角重新审视这类模型，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u22dfae24" id="u22dfae24" style="color: #2A4200">重点关注训练与采样阶段中实际可操作的对象和算法</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8f9a4a48" id="u8f9a4a48">，而非过度依赖其背后的统计过程推导。其目的在于更清晰地揭示各组件之间的关系，并识别整体系统中的设计自由度。论文聚焦于这样一类模型：它们利用神经网络刻画训练数据在加入高斯噪声后、随噪声水平变化的边缘分布的 score，因此全文讨论均建立在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u06d2f600" id="u06d2f600">去噪 score matching </span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2fa3919e" id="u2fa3919e">框架之上</span></li><li fid="u37f40dd8" data-lake-id="uf7078d03" id="uf7078d03"><span data-lake-id="ub09d3dce" id="ub09d3dce">论文围绕扩散模型的图像采样过程展开研究，识别效果最优的时间离散化方式，将高阶 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7385389f" id="u7385389f">Runge–Kutta</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u90a1fa9b" id="u90a1fa9b"> 方法引入采样，评估不同采样调度策略，并分析采样中随机性的作用。这些改进显著减少图像生成所需的采样步数，且改进后的采样器可作为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub6b78b2e" id="ub6b78b2e">即插即用</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7f67eef0" id="u7f67eef0">模块，直接应用于多种已有扩散模型</span></li><li fid="u37f40dd8" data-lake-id="u6b8786a5" id="u6b8786a5"><span data-lake-id="u82fef89c" id="u82fef89c">论文关注 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ee3d79c" id="u5ee3d79c">score</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0b3a8f8e" id="u0b3a8f8e"> 网络的训练机制。在仍采用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u337ef9c4" id="u337ef9c4">DDPM</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2327c25b" id="u2327c25b">、</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5c3bac32" id="u5c3bac32">NCSN</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u18a4f2ad" id="u18a4f2ad"> 等常用架构的基础上，首次从原则层面对扩散模型中网络输入、输出及损失函数的预条件化进行系统分析，并总结出改善训练动态的最佳实践</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="K3fRN" id="K3fRN" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u3a92df31" id="u3a92df31">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="u733f04f5" id="u733f04f5"> 𝑬𝒙𝒑𝒓𝒆𝒔𝒔𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝒅𝒊𝒇𝒇𝒖𝒔𝒊𝒐𝒏 𝒎𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔 𝒊𝒏 𝒂 𝒄𝒐𝒎𝒎𝒐𝒏 𝒇𝒓𝒂𝒎𝒆𝒘𝒐𝒓𝒌</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ueba4879e" id="ueba4879e"><span data-lake-id="u8577fa44" id="u8577fa44">设数据分布为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F196609e5044ccf30940062add3127785.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FykqJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc05d6273" id="uc05d6273">，其标准差为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F475d819a0c758d15fb0d3a30edc7bb94.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ETGDY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub19d8bf4" id="ub19d8bf4">。进一步考虑一族经平滑化后的分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x%3B%5C%5Csigma)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffb70b0683d10eb8536bb3f9f5d023941.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JY1IL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d1ee615" id="u7d1ee615">，其构造方式为向原始数据中加入标准差为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5dc558fc0a992f8e89b9b7c854c1c446.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tQB6R%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5601290e" id="u5601290e">的独立同分布高斯噪声。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%20%5C%5Cgg%20%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fab6880c247727e5e69b890fdaabb8ef0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i3M2w%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u809a1784" id="u809a1784">时，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x%3B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0183f7aae8d13210244380850b584b28.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OrVkZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9c268fe1" id="u9c268fe1">在实际中几乎无法与纯高斯噪声区分。扩散模型的基本思想是首先随机采样一个噪声图像</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2C%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%5E2%20I)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F324c7c76d984db7584ed1d13d17788da.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uPnaZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0244f25f" id="u0244f25f">，随后按照噪声水平</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_0%3D%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%20%3E%20%5C%5Csigma_1%20%3E%20%5C%5Ccdots%20%3E%20%5C%5Csigma_N%20%3D%200%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9318050163cc39cb3a0f0530f333d00a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lhPUs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf8513646" id="uf8513646">逐步对其进行去噪，得到一系列图像</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5b13ed0ae41bee9defcf75f2efc5f060.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tetpz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uca4cade0" id="uca4cade0">，并使得在每一个噪声水平下均满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_i%20%5C%5Csim%20p(x_i%3B%5C%5Csigma_i)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fea6f1d037e9655df4b824367cc6820c0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BlOW1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf254267b" id="uf254267b">。因此，该过程的终点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F31fd125c38e42ab87067ba1c58682f07.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IXhjd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u48dfe754" id="u48dfe754">便服从真实数据分布</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue9745f61" id="ue9745f61"><span data-lake-id="ue38893db" id="ue38893db">Song 提出一种随机微分方程（SDE），用于刻画样本的时间演化过程，保证样本在各时刻均符合相应噪声水平下的边缘分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x%3B%5C%5Csigma(t))%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F16c2a5247b07e98d1e0c735b81e91174.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22niQ5b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u40a3ac68" id="u40a3ac68">。这使得上述过程可以通过一种随机求解器来实现，其在每一步迭代中既会去除噪声，也会重新注入噪声。与此同时，他们还给出一个与之对应的概率流常微分方程（ODE），其中唯一的随机性来源于初始噪声图像</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XcPzl%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2f5288e1" id="u2f5288e1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u591d6270" id="u591d6270">概率流 ODE 在时间正向推进时连续增加图像中的噪声水平，而在时间反向推进时则连续降低噪声水平。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u99c9a7ea" id="u99c9a7ea">为明确该 ODE 的具体形式，首先需要给定一个噪声调度函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe322edd65022b6dfe2836422aed20f47.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ilqjg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2af86820" id="u2af86820">，用于定义时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K0MU4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8b58b83d" id="u8b58b83d">所对应的目标噪声水平。例如令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(t)%5C%5Cpropto%20%5C%5Csqrt%7Bt%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F066ac1d7b034426887874c7d91135b22.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ONhcn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub852dcb3" id="ub852dcb3">在数学上是较为自然的，因为它对应于恒定速度的热扩散过程。然而调度函数的选取在实践中具有重要影响，因此不应仅凭理论上的便利性来决定</span></p><ul list="u965d51e9"><li fid="u35afc176" data-lake-id="u670793c8" id="u670793c8"><span data-lake-id="u40cbaf59" id="u40cbaf59">概率流 ODE 的核心特征在于：若某一样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_a%20%5C%5Csim%20p(x%3B%5C%5Csigma(t_a))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff85b91fa9bb4a5528671e0b2536d32ad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qZG5Q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud2e8c909" id="ud2e8c909">从时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_a%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8360e2c6f2fa315df32c16dd25c9a207.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dgDYL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubf1a46e5" id="ubf1a46e5">演化至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb03bb17222c6a3ce023dc9c64ff465dd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ugqfe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8346f694" id="u8346f694">（无论是正向还是反向），则得到的样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8c4ec20afd6f7122ba83cd0fac88840c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22q3TC6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud91b94f8" id="ud91b94f8">仍满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_b%20%5C%5Csim%20p(x%3B%5C%5Csigma(t_b))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F00569db45721bf9c4acd366f389069c7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Lg3op%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucff137c5" id="ucff137c5">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u065d27d4" id="u065d27d4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%20%3D%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Csigma(t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20%5C%5Csigma(t)%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%3B%20%5C%5Csigma(t))%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01c840224e0ce448bb4c68bae9b65dcf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WAQP0%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u8ad1e4e0"><li fid="ub560592a" data-lake-id="u659a7618" id="u659a7618"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_x%20%5C%5Clog%20p(x%3B%5C%5Csigma)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F04700d90dc7b670869ed472eaa61814c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EofLH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucf2fee48" id="ucf2fee48">即为 score function，它是一个向量场，在给定噪声水平下指向数据密度更高的方向。直观而言，该 ODE 的一个无穷小正向步会将样本从数据分布附近进一步推离，其速率取决于噪声水平的变化；等价地，一个反向步则会将样本推向数据分布</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uba32159b" id="uba32159b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9eb68cf8" id="u9eb68cf8">去噪 score matching：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u81111ad4" id="u81111ad4">score function 具有一个重要性质，即它不依赖于底层密度函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x%3B%5C%5Csigma)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffb70b0683d10eb8536bb3f9f5d023941.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xQ8e4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua6636f9a" id="ua6636f9a">那个通常难以计算的归一化常数，因而更易于求值。具体而言，若</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D(x%3B%5C%5Csigma)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8fcf8181157050ce3cd05a2fbc9f1bd0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vWav5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3c620158" id="u3c620158">表示一个去噪函数，并且对于每个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F788df1ba344b3092def7590d1be6b4d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vPjzv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9117c14e" id="u9117c14e">都最小化如下期望</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F12ea5d8dd1e9b2b63ca602dd183dde08.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Lx9jE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3a303308" id="u3a303308">去噪误差</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6de152d2" id="u6de152d2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7By%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bn%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%20%5C%5Csigma%5E2%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%7D%20%5C%5C%7C%20D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7By%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bn%7D%3B%20%5C%5Csigma)%20-%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7By%7D%20%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%2C%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20then%20%7D%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%3B%20%5C%5Csigma)%20%3D%20(D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%3B%20%5C%5Csigma)%20-%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D)%20%2F%20%5C%5Csigma%5E2%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F162637a2b21f1d8c688c338965a213aa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L3nMY%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u10c6dd34"><li fid="u0d6e8631" data-lake-id="ud4d66802" id="ud4d66802"><span data-lake-id="u17b02099" id="u17b02099">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf98c0ddcbe9c1e535f767c78c3aa813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U9YCX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uefd91b70" id="uefd91b70">为训练图像，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lLR4X%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u187ff6b7" id="u187ff6b7">为噪声。从这一角度看，score function 实际上刻画样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BOnqJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub0756b71" id="ub0756b71">中噪声成分相对于信号成分的分离方式。扩散模型的关键观察在于，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D(x%3B%5C%5Csigma)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8fcf8181157050ce3cd05a2fbc9f1bd0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hap5b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u84aa3c48" id="u84aa3c48">可以由神经网络</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta(x%3B%5C%5Csigma)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F902692a2e69f415041382046efacabb5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HVjc1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udd3bd45b" id="udd3bd45b">来实现并进行训练。需要注意的是，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3dd6d3deb6c2d585ea87ea1840df81c3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N5Hm6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4e2130f7" id="u4e2130f7">中还可能包含额外的预处理与后处理步骤</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u10212597" id="u10212597"><strong><span data-lake-id="u73c1d7e4" id="u73c1d7e4">随时间变化的信号缩放：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u11870c64" id="u11870c64">某些方法引入额外的缩放调度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22ec3101c5f2e618da3b0616216d3107.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hpnbq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud1d92313" id="ud1d92313">。这会改变随时间变化的概率密度，从而也会改变 ODE 的解轨迹</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9765bee4" id="u9765bee4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bs(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Ds(t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%20-%20s(t)%5E2%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Csigma(t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20%5C%5Csigma(t)%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D%7Bs(t)%7D%3B%20%5C%5Csigma(t)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F25e8dae89f44abdc9578ca7f5692c263.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f6u08%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u137f0923" id="u137f0923"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3c803c99" id="u3c803c99">通过离散化求解：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u106a0a58" id="u106a0a58">ODE 的解可通过数值积分获得，即在离散时间区间上进行有限步推进。这一过程既需要选择积分方案，例如 Euler 方法或某种 Runge–Kutta 变体，也需要确定离散采样时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bt_0%2Ct_1%2C%5C%5Cdots%2Ct_N%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd248c48c10e870c710777d59ba7ea675.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BMd4p%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub605bb67" id="ub605bb67">。许多已有工作采用 Euler 方法，但论文表明二阶求解器在计算代价与性能之间提供更优折中</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="ufiWu" id="ufiWu" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u86ccc294" id="u86ccc294">🕊️</span><span data-lake-id="uae30fca5" id="uae30fca5"> 𝑰𝒎𝒑𝒓𝒐𝒗𝒆𝒎𝒆𝒏𝒕𝒔 𝒕𝒐 𝒅𝒆𝒕𝒆𝒓𝒎𝒊𝒏𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒊𝒄 𝒔𝒂𝒎𝒑𝒍𝒊𝒏𝒈</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u85046da6" id="u85046da6"><span data-lake-id="u87065925" id="u87065925">提高生成质量和/或降低采样计算成本，一直是扩散模型研究中的常见主题。作者提出的基本假设是：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u96cbf3b4" id="u96cbf3b4">与采样过程相关的设计选择，在很大程度上独立于其他组件</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udbaa2fcc" id="udbaa2fcc">，例如网络结构和训练细节。换言之，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3dd6d3deb6c2d585ea87ea1840df81c3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mehvQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5df7e314" id="u5df7e314">的训练方式不应决定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe322edd65022b6dfe2836422aed20f47.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SeSoo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u29dd5682" id="u29dd5682">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22ec3101c5f2e618da3b0616216d3107.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bDxQx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5457a76e" id="u5457a76e">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bt_i%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38afa4d9e1116ec3a6a883b5a594b334.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g7QWj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0ea79c77" id="u0ea79c77">的选取，反之亦然；</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3af90689" id="u3af90689" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">从采样器的角度看，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3dd6d3deb6c2d585ea87ea1840df81c3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vsmbP%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud8b9fae4" id="ud8b9fae4" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">只是一个黑箱 </span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ub33e64cf" id="ub33e64cf" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1775970796772-dc09fb0c-3086-4cdb-bb70-20576bb625ac.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ubfadda89-90ad-4536-8652-3b02e688548%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9faad5de-3321-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A790.6364135742188%2C%22height%22%3A244%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A125493%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1362%2C%22originHeight%22%3A420%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22URVETHEDOTINDICATESTHELOWESTNFEWHOSEFIDISWITHIN3%25OFTHELOWESTOBSERVEDFLD.%22%2C%22x%22%3A21%2C%22y%22%3A373%2C%22width%22%3A1275%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221GURE2%3ACOMPASONODETEMINISTICSAMPLINGMETHODSUSINGTHREEPRE-TRAINEDMODELS%2CFOREACH%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A341%2C%22width%22%3A1329%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UNCONDCIFAR-10VPODE%22%2C%22x%22%3A75%2C%22y%22%3A284%2C%22width%22%3A363%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220VEODE%22%2C%22x%22%3A737%2C%22y%22%3A285%2C%22width%22%3A156%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CIFAR-1O%22%2C%22x%22%3A621%2C%22y%22%3A283%2C%22width%22%3A153%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A225%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CLASS-COND.IMAGENET-64%2CDDM%22%2C%22x%22%3A926%2C%22y%22%3A286%2C%22width%22%3A422%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORIGINALSAMPLER%22%2C%22x%22%3A1127%2C%22y%22%3A37%2C%22width%22%3A156%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEBUNCOND%22%2C%22x%22%3A406%2C%22y%22%3A285%2C%22width%22%3A236%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OURREIMPLEMENTATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A1127%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A166%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-BLACK-BOXRK45%22%2C%22x%22%3A1123%2C%22y%22%3A129%2C%22width%22%3A145%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2BOUO(T)%26S(T)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1133%2C%22y%22%3A107%2C%22width%22%3A146%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2BHEUN%26OURTIY%22%2C%22x%22%3A1130%2C%22y%22%3A85%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E(CCLASS%22%2C%22x%22%3A858%2C%22y%22%3A285%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22128256512102%22%2C%22x%22%3A1124%2C%22y%22%3A248%2C%22width%22%3A206%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222565121%22%2C%22x%22%3A309%2C%22y%22%3A247%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%93%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A33%2C%22y%22%3A232%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2219%22%2C%22x%22%3A866%2C%22y%22%3A246%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22048%22%2C%22x%22%3A787%2C%22y%22%3A248%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2228%22%2C%22x%22%3A642%2C%22y%22%3A247%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FID%22%2C%22x%22%3A892%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22512%22%2C%22x%22%3A711%2C%22y%22%3A247%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2216%22%2C%22x%22%3A975%2C%22y%22%3A247%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22128%22%2C%22x%22%3A259%2C%22y%22%3A248%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2279%22%2C%22x%22%3A1087%2C%22y%22%3A219%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2264%22%2C%22x%22%3A212%2C%22y%22%3A249%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2232%22%2C%22x%22%3A562%2C%22y%22%3A245%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%22%2C%22x%22%3A161%2C%22y%22%3A250%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2220%22%2C%22x%22%3A901%2C%22y%22%3A34%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2264%22%2C%22x%22%3A1063%2C%22y%22%3A248%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221024%22%2C%22x%22%3A422%2C%22y%22%3A247%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2235%22%2C%22x%22%3A167%2C%22y%22%3A220%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%93%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A459%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A61%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%808%22%2C%22x%22%3A52%2C%22y%22%3A249%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2290%22%2C%22x%22%3A465%2C%22y%22%3A79%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A62%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2216%22%2C%22x%22%3A97%2C%22y%22%3A249%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f0efef%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u68dc3cf4%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u4caee589" id="u4caee589"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9427c074" id="u9427c074">离散化与高阶积分器：对 ODE 的数值求解本质上是对真实解轨迹的近似。求解器在每一步都会引入截断误差，而这一误差会在</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GKNHd%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="udc7450c8" id="udc7450c8">个步骤中不断累积。一般而言，局部误差相对于步长呈超线性缩放，因此增大</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZyJsX%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud5481dd0" id="ud5481dd0">通常能够提升解的精度</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u88a0b227" id="u88a0b227"><span data-lake-id="uea70a912" id="uea70a912">常用的 Euler 方法是一阶 ODE 求解器，其局部误差相对于步长</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67df0f404d0960fadcc99f6258733f22.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c32Tr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u18e12bdf" id="u18e12bdf">为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(h%5E2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb4a5e6fe1155fc4b0e835e2604ea696e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mm2vu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u390b8b9b" id="u390b8b9b">。更高阶的 Runge–Kutta 方法在误差缩放方面更有优势，但每一步需要多次评估</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3dd6d3deb6c2d585ea87ea1840df81c3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KWRN4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue6560da4" id="ue6560da4">。通过大量实验，作者发现 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u320d86cb" id="u320d86cb">Heun 二阶方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u13770c17" id="u13770c17">（亦称改进 Euler 法或梯形法）在截断误差与 NFE 之间提供极佳的折中；正如算法 1 所示，该方法在计算</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bi%2B1%7D%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F195b345caac4162bd65e8aecb8f318ea.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XiR9I%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u79cdb991" id="u79cdb991">时引入额外的校正步骤，以补偿</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26e255f82b8cc1651e50a820c5a16dc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gwSo5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc3aade9b" id="uc3aade9b">到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_%7Bi%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdd391a6754b899fc8e4f2de1da075e97.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Swstk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ued152a65" id="ued152a65">之间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22dx%2Fdt%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc89e11c85f06fd62c01b05692a1c0f36.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22v4Gsq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3f63b776" id="u3f63b776">的变化。这一步校正以每步额外一次</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3dd6d3deb6c2d585ea87ea1840df81c3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DWFP8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5cd5ee3b" id="u5cd5ee3b">评估为代价，将局部误差降低到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(h%5E3)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff1c63e2088cbde48766f3193d2feee99.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IxSiu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u239ccb87" id="u239ccb87">。需要指出的是，当步进到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7254509f0e5ec75d00dd174887e2e6c0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ipKv5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub7b29300" id="ub7b29300">时会导致除零问题，因此在该特殊情况下作者退回使用 Euler 方法</span></p><p data-lake-id="u78b55b9c" id="u78b55b9c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1775971136754-0faaa2c4-c0f8-40ee-9f41-2470fda26962.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u221d67a6-e31e-4731-b1cf-b32504808bb%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9faad5de-3321-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A711.6364135742188%2C%22height%22%3A272%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A157708%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1358%2C%22originHeight%22%3A519%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22REHEUNSAMPLER(DE(W%3BO)%2CA(T)%2CS(T)%2CTIEO...%2CN))%22%2C%22x%22%3A170%2C%22y%22%3A78%2C%22width%22%3A717%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22APPLY2ORDERCORRECTIONUNLESSGOESTOZERO%22%2C%22x%22%3A725%2C%22y%22%3A316%2C%22width%22%3A628%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222NDORDERMETHODWITHARBITRARYO(T)ANDS(T).%22%2C%22x%22%3A709%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A631%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210I%E5%8D%81(T%2B1-TI)(DI%E5%8D%81D)%22%2C%22x%22%3A242%2C%22y%22%3A429%2C%22width%22%3A449%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RETURNNOISE-FREESAMPLEATTY%22%2C%22x%22%3A950%2C%22y%22%3A468%2C%22width%22%3A401%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EXPLICITTRAPEZOIDALRULEATTI%2B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A950%2C%22y%22%3A432%2C%22width%22%3A399%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DETERMINISTI