220MIN%E4%B8%890.02%22%2C%22x%22%3A420%2C%22y%22%3A576%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PARAMETERS%22%2C%22x%22%3A9%2C%22y%22%3A576%2C%22width%22%3A108%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(ANY)%22%2C%22x%22%3A912%2C%22y%22%3A303%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%2FR2(NOTE%3A*%22%2C%22x%22%3A646%2C%22y%22%3A538%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ODESOLVER%22%2C%22x%22%3A6%2C%22y%22%3A71%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220MAX%E4%B8%89100%22%2C%22x%22%3A428%2C%22y%22%3A604%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NCSN%2B%2B%22%2C%22x%22%3A431%2C%22y%22%3A301%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SCHEDULE%22%2C%22x%22%3A5%2C%22y%22%3A206%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IMESTEPS%22%2C%22x%22%3A6%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22M%E4%B8%890%22%2C%22x%22%3A652%2C%22y%22%3A141%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22N(OMAX)%22%2C%22x%22%3A511%2C%22y%22%3A520%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SCALING%22%2C%22x%22%3A7%2C%22y%22%3A244%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220MAXP%22%2C%22x%22%3A920%2C%22y%22%3A106%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DDPM%22%2C%22x%22%3A647%2C%22y%22%3A301%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%2FG2%22%2C%22x%22%3A433%2C%22y%22%3A535%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EULER%22%2C%22x%22%3A647%2C%22y%22%3A69%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TI%3CN%22%2C%22x%22%3A156%2C%22y%22%3A107%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220-1%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A648%2C%22y%22%3A173%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%E5%8D%811%22%2C%22x%22%3A728%2C%22y%22%3A161%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EULER%22%2C%22x%22%3A432%2C%22y%22%3A68%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EULER%22%2C%22x%22%3A227%2C%22y%22%3A70%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%2FG2%22%2C%22x%22%3A214%2C%22y%22%3A535%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22O(T%22%2C%22x%22%3A162%2C%22y%22%3A204%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%800%22%2C%22x%22%3A648%2C%22y%22%3A368%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%800%22%2C%22x%22%3A213%2C%22y%22%3A369%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22x%22%3A430%2C%22y%22%3A201%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22x%22%3A912%2C%22y%22%3A209%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%22%2C%22x%22%3A910%2C%22y%22%3A244%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2f2f2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u4d6e47b1%22%7D"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="hq7OY" id="hq7OY" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u18fe81d1" id="u18fe81d1">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="ue6b3106b" id="ue6b3106b"> 𝐃𝐏𝐌-𝐬𝐨𝐥𝐯𝐞𝐫</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u4e5900d8" id="u4e5900d8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ba15b7e" id="u5ba15b7e">扩散概率模型（DPMs）正逐渐成为一类性能强大的生成模型。DPMs 可以由离散时间随机过程或连续时间随机微分方程所定义，其核心思想是学习逐步去除施加在数据样本上的噪声。与广泛使用的生成对抗网络和变分自编码器相比，DPMs 不仅能够计算精确似然，而且在图像生成任务上往往能够获得更好的样本质量</span></strong></p><ul list="u43a96bdb"><li fid="uc44d22ee" data-lake-id="ud1bd068b" id="ud1bd068b"><span data-lake-id="u2e82ee7d" id="u2e82ee7d">尽管 DPMs 在生成质量方面表现优异，其采样速度仍然较慢。为获得高质量样本，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3ff8f0f2" id="u3ff8f0f2" style="color: #270070">DPMs 通常需要进行数百次甚至数千次顺序的大规模神经网络评估，因此其采样速度显著慢于单步生成的 GANs 或 VAEs</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u37433512" id="u37433512">。这种低效率已经成为 DPMs 在下游任务中广泛应用的关键瓶颈，设计高效的 DPM 采样器已成为一个迫切需求</span></li><li fid="uc44d22ee" data-lake-id="u319fbdba" id="u319fbdba"><span data-lake-id="u67d05b27" id="u67d05b27">DPMs 的采样过程也可以被等价地视为求解相应的扩散常微分方程。针对这一视角，作者提出扩散 ODE 解的一个精确形式化表达。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uac95f9ed" id="uac95f9ed" style="color: #004347">不同于以往工作将所有项都交由黑盒 ODE 求解器处理，该方法对解中的线性部分进行解析计算。进一步通过变量替换，这一解可以等价地简化为关于神经网络的一个指数加权积分</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc68c564c" id="uc68c564c"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc5865a7b" id="uc5865a7b">现有的 DPM 快速采样方法大致可分为两类</span></strong></p><ul list="ua17bc4dc"><li fid="u604d69da" data-lake-id="ube04a149" id="ube04a149"><span data-lake-id="ue4738d19" id="ue4738d19">第一类包括</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0283b0d2" id="u0283b0d2">知识蒸馏以及噪声水平或样本轨迹学习</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u13538629" id="u13538629">。这类方法在高效采样之前通常需要一个可能代价较高的训练阶段。此外，它们的适用性和灵活性也可能受到限制，因为将方法迁移到不同模型、数据集或不同采样步数设定下，往往需要付出额外努力</span></li><li fid="u604d69da" data-lake-id="u311a3f61" id="u311a3f61"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf52dfdd0" id="uf52dfdd0">第二类是免训练采样器，其能够以一种简单的即插即用方式适用于任意预训练 DPM</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubfa95520" id="ubfa95520">。免训练采样器主要包括采用隐式或解析式的生成过程、先进的微分方程求解器，以及动态规划方法。然而，这些方法通常仍然需要约 50 次函数评估才能生成高质量样本，而这种质量大致才可与基础采样器在约 1000 次函数评估下生成的结果相当，因此依旧较为耗时</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc769996a" id="uc769996a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ude4ad9b0" id="ude4ad9b0" style="color: #000000">作者进一步将免训练采样器的效率提升到新的水平，使其能够在少步采样（few-step sampling）场景下生成高质量样本，即在大约 10 步顺序函数评估内完成采样</span></strong></p><ul list="u1b3eef7c"><li fid="uc834c556" data-lake-id="ub43c6f41" id="ub43c6f41"><span data-lake-id="ue3519897" id="ue3519897">将 DPM 采样视为求解相应扩散常微分方程的问题，并对扩散 ODE 的结构进行细致分析。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3c863982" id="u3c863982" style="color: #270070">扩散 ODE 具有一种半线性结构，即它由数据变量的线性函数与由神经网络参数化的非线性函数共同构成</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1f9f9092" id="u1f9f9092">。此前的免训练采样方法并未充分利用这一结构，而是直接采用黑盒微分方程求解器</span></li><li fid="uc834c556" data-lake-id="ua76f8a0a" id="ua76f8a0a"><span data-lake-id="ue0c6fddf" id="ue0c6fddf">为充分利用这一半线性结构，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u68f471a9" id="u68f471a9" style="color: #7E45E8">通过对解的线性部分进行解析计算，推导出扩散 ODE 解的精确表达，从而避免线性部分离散化所引入的误差。进一步地，通过变量替换，该解又可等价地化简为神经网络项的指数加权积分</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u38bdb96f" id="u38bdb96f">。由于这种积分形式具有特殊结构，因此可以借助指数积分器的数值方法进行高效近似</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u54e8e475" id="u54e8e475"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1d861825" id="u1d861825" style="color: #70000D">基于上述解的形式化表达，提出 DPM-Solver，通过对上述积分进行近似来高效求解扩散 ODE。具体而言，构建 DPM-Solver 的一阶、二阶和三阶版本，并为其提供收敛阶保证。还进一步为 DPM-Solver 设计自适应步长调度策略。总体而言，DPM-Solver 既适用于连续时间 DPM，也适用于离散时间 DPM，同时还可用于带有分类器引导的条件采样</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="gTzQP" id="gTzQP" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u40118660" id="u40118660">🕊️</span><span data-lake-id="ufd5d9aaf" id="ufd5d9aaf"> 𝑫𝒊𝒇𝒇𝒖𝒔𝒊𝒐𝒏 𝑷𝒓𝒐𝒃𝒂𝒃𝒊𝒍𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒊𝒄 𝑴𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ue58bdd50" id="ue58bdd50"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5efb555c" id="u5efb555c">前向过程与扩散 SDE：设</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5ED%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7f51d8976bd75823f6a6b361fa8898de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hCdph%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc04f6445" id="uc04f6445">是</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F558270b7f0a90c3c286b860273d106a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pTzvR%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1070cf05" id="u1070cf05">维随机变量，其分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_0(x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79377785e1dab626b89623067c704953.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GsBht%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub6bc45bf" id="ub6bc45bf">未知。扩散概率模型定义一个以前向时间演化过程</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bx_t%5C%5C%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Cin%5B0%2CT%5D%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc4943fd0e4d7e4321bf6c1807105949e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OzFjc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u99cc7aa1" id="u99cc7aa1">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%3E0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9a396468440c64edf48c937dcb880ee7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GDNdv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u67e0decf" id="u67e0decf">，且该过程以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bLhVj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud48056a7" id="ud48056a7">为起点，使得对任意</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2CT%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa5cef51fad9b5deb42314ba69c08cadd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lRpZP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2363de5d" id="u2363de5d">，在给定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uDZh2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u03df4ab5" id="u03df4ab5">的条件下，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xnNwq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u77a7d4f2" id="u77a7d4f2">的条件分布满足</span></p><p data-lake-id="u657e065e" id="u657e065e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20q_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Calpha(t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Csigma%5E2(t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D)%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1d6b3a8395dc69162789460de97d0749.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZlFQb%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ubaea755d" id="ubaea755d"><span data-lake-id="ue83a61e9" id="ue83a61e9">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha(t)%2C%5C%5Csigma(t)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D_%2B%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe88102dd469b15f11a3760d006dc30e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HnPKA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4e5fea8b" id="u4e5fea8b">是关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd99979941e2b40b5ffd75f89c83e37b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22drB8a%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u533470ba" id="u533470ba">的可微函数，且其导数有界。为简便起见，分别记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%2C%5C%5Csigma_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1a822952fd86be10ddc181471a412e97.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kCv0e%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u89047be9" id="u89047be9">。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F934371f608c3b1245db5f46f4369b40b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gYu1w%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucda580b8" id="ucda580b8">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47db06c23eda0f320721582da4e8a231.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dx82B%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u55088f14" id="u55088f14">的具体选取被称为 DPM 的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua9972e7b" id="ua9972e7b">噪声调度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucc9f5fd7" id="ucc9f5fd7">。令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_t(x_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F74b3268a975d91f7b337c24a396442a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22luAen%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua81d020e" id="ua81d020e">表示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WF1sk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2cb4ab78" id="u2cb4ab78">的边缘分布，DPM 通过适当设计噪声调度，使得</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_T(x_T)%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_T%7C0%2C%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D%5E2I)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F43da5342bb93075a14869579aabe9cbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kg8aL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0a3e77af" id="u0a3e77af">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D%3E0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe4d417bc604c157ba70740118c5799d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dwuNC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6320d225" id="u6320d225">，要求信噪比</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5E2%2F%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb731d83419431917fcfc8b8a34d6d068.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N5GL5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u561d73b5" id="u561d73b5">关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bn378%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0224e0f6" id="u0224e0f6">严格单调递减。进一步地，Kingma 等证明，对于任意</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2CT%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa5cef51fad9b5deb42314ba69c08cadd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sSTD3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u27f25bb0" id="u27f25bb0">，如下随机微分方程与上式具有相同的转移分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B0t%7D(x_t%7Cx_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda56a62b5f3e8ed8b973dc241bf7d722.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tBvPN%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u35588ee9" id="u35588ee9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%3D%20f(t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%20%2B%20g(t)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bw%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%20%5C%5Csim%20q_0(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa60de9724505c926a1800df093ce1242.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wyNvo%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u3bf761b2" id="u3bf761b2"><span data-lake-id="u81ef16e8" id="u81ef16e8">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5ED%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa8cb32ed7d53734d37bc57d4ddb341cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GGbrj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u46fff4a1" id="u46fff4a1">为标准 Wiener 过程，且</span></p><p data-lake-id="u68511710" id="u68511710" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20f(t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20g%5E2(t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20-%202%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97173ae279cb66a8491e94535fa53643.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OV5lq%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uffa6a3c5" id="uffa6a3c5"><span data-lake-id="u53f013fc" id="u53f013fc">在一定正则条件下，Song 等证明，所定义的前向过程存在一个等价的逆向过程，该过程从时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x6ij4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7242e294" id="u7242e294">演化至 0，并以边缘分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_T(x_T)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb556be5a922a868dd6f2965c51cde01d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22T726T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4f12365" id="ud4f12365">为初始分布</span></p><p data-lake-id="ucdc16ff9" id="ucdc16ff9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%3D%20%5Bf(t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20-%20g%5E2(t)%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20q_t(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%5D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%20%2B%20g(t)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bw%7D%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T%20%5C%5Csim%20q_T(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T)%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3c3c157b503e9408ee47e86e1c501322.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pyG6I%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u24934524" id="u24934524"><span data-lake-id="u34491414" id="u34491414">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7Bw%7D_t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F98bf652a6a3c470463760b78e7f14c69.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mfjr5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1cc33a60" id="u1cc33a60">表示逆时间方向上的标准 Wiener 过程。唯一未知的项是任意时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kvKKD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u07c9e9f9" id="u07c9e9f9">对应的 score function </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cnabla_x%20%5C%5Clog%20q_t(x_t).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb29dc01dd60423fcf2f14cbb47ede66c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P0oXR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud1d4e3eb" id="ud1d4e3eb">DPM 使用参数为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f8f02fd1006c7ebfd3af79fe298d78e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ip22Y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9a83848d" id="u9a83848d">的神经网络</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47733497020167736be05b25b8d2218c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZuTKf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u25f77a1b" id="u25f77a1b">来估计缩放后的 score function，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Csigma_t%5C%5Cnabla_x%20%5C%5Clog%20q_t(x_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa85a647ff1c679975209f1775477276f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CPmqO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u69b994d5" id="u69b994d5">。参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hREdE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5d5cb183" id="u5d5cb183">通过最小化如下目标函数进行优化</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc2228460" id="uc2228460" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Ctheta%3B%20%5C%5Comega(t))%20%26%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Cint_0%5ET%20%5C%5Comega(t)%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_t(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%20%2B%20%5C%5Csigma_t%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20q_t(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%20%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Cint_0%5ET%20%5C%5Comega(t)%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_0(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%20-%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%20%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%20%2B%20C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F19dc8466b7098ca57f82da47227ad789.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Bvkm8%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua5b65298" id="ua5b65298"><span data-lake-id="uf72f3a18" id="uf72f3a18">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Comega(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F16e1a68782ace03cd1d195e4e678cfe0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TU0Q1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u922f8803" id="u922f8803">为加权函数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%5C%5Csim%20q(%5C%5Cepsilon)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cepsilon%7C0%2CI)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbc01e8427047dd1ebcb78c1b804b7395.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Sjekl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua1e9ce68" id="ua1e9ce68">，且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%3D%5C%5Calpha_tx_0%2B%5C%5Csigma_t%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9ba5bff33d88e550e673c645aa035143.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vC4WD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u656dea31" id="u656dea31">，常数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa42a4fc28b384cc408de066beed57485.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FwrCW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uffcc6c70" id="uffcc6c70">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P60qX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud6508ff7" id="ud6508ff7">无关。由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47733497020167736be05b25b8d2218c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eTgnD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udd90b8c1" id="udd90b8c1">也可以被理解为对加入到 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oGj7M%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1276e8fd" id="u1276e8fd">中的高斯噪声进行预测，通常被称</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7e640b81" id="u7e640b81">噪声预测模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5955b4bd" id="u5955b4bd">。鉴于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F61e299d19af64c3544d6c616cc83d54f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fY6Wk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u406aaad6" id="u406aaad6">所对应的真实目标为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Csigma_t%5C%5Cnabla_x%5C%5Clog%20q_t(x_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3504c9c3defcef3cd5cfae4c1750fe14.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zaYEJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8fe27ac5" id="u8fe27ac5">，DPM 用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%2F%5C%5Csigma_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4e7477968e4b7a7267980a9f78b014d8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jPivr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3dfed0c4" id="u3dfed0c4">替代 score function，从而定义出如下参数化逆过程（即扩散 SDE），其从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XySPg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud76c186c" id="ud76c186c">时刻演化至 0，并以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_T%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2C%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D%5E2I)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe316b7c202e3207262b2bab1ac33f20f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lpR34%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u65b72756" id="u65b72756">为初始条件</span></p><p data-lake-id="ubf48b378" id="ubf48b378" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20f(t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bg%5E2(t)%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%20%2B%20g(t)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bw%7D%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B0%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D%5E2%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D)%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0002ef019713cb0849ce3065fa974a8e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XTz2M%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6126d3a0" id="u6126d3a0"><span data-lake-id="ubb6b3cd7" id="ubb6b3cd7">因此，可以通过数值求解器对扩散 SDE 从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MZTh4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0da60ebb" id="u0da60ebb">到 0 进行离散化求解，从而生成样本。Song 等证明，DPM 的传统 ancestral sampling 方法可以被视为一个一阶 SDE 求解器。然而，这类一阶方法通常需要数百次甚至数千次函数评估才能收敛，从而导致极其缓慢的采样速度</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3aa391b5" id="u3aa391b5"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub64587b9" id="ub64587b9">扩散（概率流）ODE：在对 SDE 进行离散化时，步长大小受到 Wiener 过程随机性的限制。当步长较大（即步数较少）时，离散求解往往难以收敛，尤其是在高维空间中更是如此</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4aa6fa83" id="u4aa6fa83">。为实现更快的采样，可以考虑与之对应</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud64cf3cf" id="ud64cf3cf">概率流常微分方程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uefa327a2" id="uefa327a2">，该 ODE 在每一时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22erhUo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ube07e3dd" id="ube07e3dd">上都与原 SDE 具有相同的边缘分布。对于 DPM，Song 等证明，对应的概率流 ODE 可写为</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub26292fb" id="ub26292fb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20%3D%20f(t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7Dg%5E2(t)%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20q_t(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T%20%5C%5Csim%20q_T(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T)%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F42ba57c91c23405e25c126d665b72ac7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ESuUz%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u403846ad" id="u403846ad"><span data-lake-id="ub3d8eac1" id="ub3d8eac1">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa21cf1a7c05261064879de9d8c2557bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qu5KZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u92501aef" id="u92501aef">的边缘分布同样为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_t(x_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F74b3268a975d91f7b337c24a396442a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PmvCZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc54f7e02" id="uc54f7e02">。进一步地，若用噪声预测模型替代 score function，则 Song 等定义如下参数化 ODE</span></p><p data-lake-id="u67793df4" id="u67793df4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bh%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%20%3A%3D%20f(t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bg%5E2(t)%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B0%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D%5E2%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D)%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F131d25b9cb663bfc79c2caa3209335d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uK3hE%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u3da77465" id="u3da77465"><span data-lake-id="u6be06a93" id="u6be06a93">样本可以通过求解该 ODE 并将时间从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe653289cfaa7dc2d2b728c1d442d046a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s0lEC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ued2cda8c" id="ued2cda8c">推进到 0 来获得。与 SDE 相比，ODE 不包含随机项，因此允许采用更大的步长进行数值求解。此外，还可以借助高效的数值 ODE 求解器来进一步加速采样。Song 等采用 RK45 ODE 求解器来求解扩散 ODE，在 CIFAR-10 数据集上，仅需约 60 次函数评估，便可达到与对应的 1000 步 SDE 求解器相当的生成质量。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u195890c0" id="u195890c0" style="color: #004347">然而，现有通用型 ODE 求解器在少步采样（约 10 步）场景下，仍难以生成令人满意的样本。目前在少步采样场景下，针对 DPM 的免训练采样器仍然较为缺乏，DPM 的采样效率问题仍然是一个亟待解决的关键挑战</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="wqWQC" id="wqWQC" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u34d00969" id="u34d00969">🐇</span><span data-lake-id="u914b0304" id="u914b0304"> 𝑪𝒖𝒔𝒕𝒐𝒎𝒊𝒛𝒆𝒅 𝑭𝒂𝒔𝒕 𝑺𝒐𝒍𝒗𝒆𝒓𝒔 𝒇𝒐𝒓 𝑫𝒊𝒇𝒇𝒖𝒔𝒊𝒐𝒏 𝑶𝑫𝑬𝒔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ud9e1b90d" id="ud9e1b90d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u736a4107" id="u736a4107">面向扩散 ODE 的定制化快速求解器：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub616b6ea" id="ub616b6ea">在高维空间中对 SDE 进行离散化通常较为困难，因此很难在少量步数内实现收敛。ODE 更易于求解，这为构造快速采样器提供可能。先前工作中采用的通用黑盒 ODE 求解器在经验上无法在少步设定下实现收敛。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4332a2c2" id="u4332a2c2" style="color: #DF2A3F">作者希望为扩散 ODE 设计一种专用求解器，从而实现快速且高质量的少步采样</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ua6a1a26a" id="ua6a1a26a"><span data-lake-id="u9cbee7dd" id="u9cbee7dd">⏳</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u65903517" id="u65903517"> 扩散 ODE 精确解的简化形式：给定时刻</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%3E0%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc56772f0e7208fba45a6476fbe934ff4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jQ764%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc0b294c4" id="uc0b294c4">处的初值</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3296487a8a647b61a2c15e423588d5ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22n6PO0%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3db2d37d" id="u3db2d37d">，对于扩散 ODE，任意时刻</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3Cs%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb60888e4a474ef570932ae7c019de920.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CcL0l%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucefb1f5a" id="ucefb1f5a">处的解</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VlqyG%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud2584dee" id="ud2584dee">都可以被化简为一种非常特殊的精确表达形式，而这一形式又能够被高效近似</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uaaf5e134" id="uaaf5e134"><span data-lake-id="u8dd01d37" id="u8dd01d37">1️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u86686a3e" id="u86686a3e"> 借助扩散 ODE 的特殊结构，其解</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qOSED%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc29bc9a3" id="uc29bc9a3">的一部分实际上可以被精确计算。扩散 ODE 右端项由两部分构成：其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f(t)x_t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F88b9bb3c08bc96974b409c1b8db5faa5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qe2iU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9588fb37" id="u9588fb37">是关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yjxQT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u71557503" id="u71557503">的线性函数，而另一项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bg%5E2(t)%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%7D%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1d40273d33520fd8ec5226d0ce3d62f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vn6XW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueb01dc46" id="ueb01dc46">由于神经网络</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47733497020167736be05b25b8d2218c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WTbFA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u39ed4864" id="u39ed4864">的存在，通常是</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e2q09%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42db7459" id="u42db7459">的非线性函数。这类 ODE 通常被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u04fc4334" id="u04fc4334" style="color: #270070">半线性 ODE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u877a653b" id="u877a653b">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u468e5bbf" id="u468e5bbf" style="color: #663000">先前工作所采用的黑盒 ODE 求解器并未利用这种半线性结构，而是将整个</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22h_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F349b2cacab05e214c9a62c6015790c66.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aEcL4%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue6929309" id="ue6929309" style="color: #663000">视作输入统一处理，这会同时对线性项和非线性项引入离散化误差。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue043ad57" id="ue043ad57">对于半线性 ODE，其在时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22F7Yjz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2e6dd26a" id="u2e6dd26a">的解可以通过常数变易公式被精确写为：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua07ebc04" id="ua07ebc04" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%3D%20e%5E%7B%5C%5Cint_s%5Et%20f(%5C%5Ctau)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Ctau%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_s%20%2B%20%5C%5Cint_s%5Et%20%5C%5Cleft(%20e%5E%7B%5C%5Cint_%5C%5Ctau%5Et%20f(r)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dr%7D%20g%5E2(%5C%5Ctau)%20%2F%202%5C%5Csigma_%5C%5Ctau%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctau%2C%20%5C%5Ctau)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Ctau%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa077d7e74c3fc3f61ce6ad9ea22acb03.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mAoiU%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u47b9334f"><li fid="uebd098df" data-lake-id="u7637f9a4" id="u7637f9a4"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufbf5e31f" id="ufbf5e31f" style="color: #2F8EF4">线性部分与非线性部分解耦</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u06ab1b4c" id="u06ab1b4c">。与黑盒 ODE 求解器不同，此时线性部分已被精确计算，从而消除线性项的近似误差。然而，非线性部分对应的积分仍然较为复杂，因为其中同时耦合与噪声调度有关的系数（即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f(%5C%5Ctau)%2C%20g(%5C%5Ctau)%2C%20%5C%5Csigma_%5C%5Ctau%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8a6e1f15d9db1e9927e2815697cf3d56.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IBfvw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9f8a7512" id="u9f8a7512">）以及复杂的神经网络</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e49f6f0f8deead694119ae9022b3641.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l2yq8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2a3649d6" id="u2a3649d6">，因此仍难以直接近似</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u58f32bc0" id="u58f32bc0"><span data-lake-id="u5939df38" id="u5939df38">2️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u9ef47899" id="u9ef47899"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0d7c5176" id="u0d7c5176" style="color: #5C0036">通过引入一个特殊变量，非线性部分的积分可以被大幅简化。定义</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_t%3A%3D%5C%5Clog(%5C%5Calpha_t%2F%5C%5Csigma_t)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4349047be01470e3425d250a2fd2216e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eb0Cn%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0930e6e0" id="u0930e6e0" style="color: #5C0036">即</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Ctext%7Blog-SNR%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7efdcd7ba5b5e7f28bff1e3402c4a9d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JhjrT%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u01c6b94b" id="u01c6b94b" style="color: #5C0036">的一半</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue745c017" id="ue745c017">。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2b723e205ab2986cc4aa607831121f5c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R0LoY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf39c2e63" id="uf39c2e63">关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YOaNJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u16f894c5" id="u16f894c5">是严格单调递减的。可以将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F44722b595d1bf03803323cda0fe6547b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UcYCP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u485dad4c" id="u485dad4c">重写为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u46483ec8" id="u46483ec8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20g%5E2(t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20-%202%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20%3D%202%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Csigma_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20-2%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clambda_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D.%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53bbc64452ae700e95d4a196351af4cc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22umfpE%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ucf5d8ec9"><li fid="u81fb5d3d" data-lake-id="uef27103c" id="uef27103c"><span data-lake-id="ubea6c219" id="ubea6c219">再结合</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f(t)%3Dd%5C%5Clog%5C%5Calpha_t%2Fdt%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3c5f6429dd5f1f6a6abbbecb97325d1b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ls88U%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7a7996c4" id="u7a7996c4">，进一步改写为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u911b83cc" id="u911b83cc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_s%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_s%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t%20%5C%5Cint_s%5Et%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clambda_%5C%5Ctau%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Ctau%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%5C%5Ctau%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%5C%5Ctau%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctau%2C%20%5C%5Ctau)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Ctau.%20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0451b05de7a7d0e078ee2c4f406abe04.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KTSkv%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u36f0817d"><li fid="uf5531706" data-lake-id="u622745c5" id="u622745c5"><span data-lake-id="ucc1a670c" id="ucc1a670c">由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda(t)%3D%5C%5Clambda_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0531163f39c3d60484c20b93a104a04f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jim0S%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucd9db67c" id="ucd9db67c">是关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Sk1Jp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufc674bcd" id="ufc674bcd">的严格单调递减函数，因此其存在反函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa3446564b4df08a82d4a65e767ebf1c6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G0tK7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u35794454" id="u35794454">，满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3Dt_%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Clambda(t)).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4c6074e757edaf308b89c734924d0f61.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uTPCq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u429be68c" id="u429be68c">进一步地，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F70a0f663ea24f20341612f0479fb18c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iFjlI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0f424a90" id="u0f424a90">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6d49e8390858ed3b4e3eb08bdfb94d2a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aVtdj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua7b6e27e" id="ua7b6e27e">的下标由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wM3F7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ube4bf257" id="ube4bf257">改写为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe520c061a407db472027709bf3f73290.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VYeyE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb5deb04" id="ucb5deb04">，并记</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Clambda%3A%3Dx_%7Bt_%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Clambda)%7D%2C%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%5C%5Clambda)%3A%3D%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7Bt_%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Clambda)%7D%2Ct_%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Clambda)).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F46aa871581f874c749d544551566e784.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Pylls%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub1733824" id="ub1733824">随后对变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Clambda%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1398210eea7813503a48fdc523bbaca4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZIAcp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9fa86702" id="u9fa86702">进行变量替换，便得到如下命题 3.1</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u50c8494b" id="u50c8494b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1776691998963-0c12f4b4-f4a5-494f-88f5-5cb9d9c35ebc.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u040a3cd1-3232-48ef-b695-ffa27974a7b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8959011e-8980-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A720%2C%22height%22%3A188%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A140243%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1724%2C%22originHeight%22%3A450%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONSIDERTHEDIFUSION0DE-HOLA.T)%3A%3DF(T)AR%2B-EOLAN.T)WITH