ta(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%5C%5Clambda)%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Clambda%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F31eba6c5123194733d5271c2c848bf99.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EeEz2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf58ff6e5" id="uf58ff6e5">称为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd538300c75e00706e329862641542bee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DrYQD%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud16121b8" id="ud16121b8">的指数加权积分</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6bbd1b36" id="u6bbd1b36">。这一积分形式非常特殊，并且与 ODE 求解器文献中的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua80c4a1a" id="ua80c4a1a">指数积分器</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uec8048b5" id="uec8048b5">密切相关</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9c9fba13" id="u9c9fba13"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9c50284a" id="u9c50284a">新的视角：</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u6be4334b" id="u6be4334b" style="color: #2A4200">给定时刻</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff15863c85fed7772f813acf1ce228a5d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zw68l%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub05f3f3f" id="ub05f3f3f" style="color: #2A4200">的状态</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3296487a8a647b61a2c15e423588d5ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GgsKI%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2be49ad8" id="u2be49ad8" style="color: #2A4200">，要近似时刻</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F06a62ed0aee1140ffbe454a791d04c49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22v8zWI%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uce3b7ddf" id="uce3b7ddf" style="color: #2A4200">处的解，本质上等价于直接近似从</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F30a0004f00d63fceb16629cce6cdbdea.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YX4sm%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud592b5e7" id="ud592b5e7" style="color: #2A4200">到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2b723e205ab2986cc4aa607831121f5c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dmqo4%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u89e0d234" id="u89e0d234" style="color: #2A4200">区间上</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F727cc56318ffb9d9409b2ecfee096cc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22heXPM%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u35d84e54" id="u35d84e54" style="color: #2A4200">的指数加权积分。这种处理方式避免线性项所带来的误差，并且与指数积分器相关的数值近似方法在已有文献中已得到较为充分的研究</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u4dad6d73" id="u4dad6d73"><span data-lake-id="u8e920e7f" id="u8e920e7f">✨</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uaecba9d0" id="uaecba9d0"> </span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ub4a6c735" id="ub4a6c735" style="color: #DF2A3F">基于解的形式化表达式，进一步构造具有收敛阶保证的扩散 ODE 高阶求解器</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ud91d10c1" id="ud91d10c1">。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue6e9dc0c" id="ue6e9dc0c" style="color: #000000">具体而言，给定时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N9Cyw%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="ufaa590fd" id="ufaa590fd" style="color: #000000">处的初值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F499e1c7651df7a60f212aad15824986f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q6C6a%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u6701172d" id="u6701172d" style="color: #000000">，以及一组从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_0%3DT%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fae46bdde78586ceeb40064fb65289ffa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UUAGk%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="uf935c4b6" id="uf935c4b6" style="color: #000000">递减到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_M%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe7cb589e121d2b9ce85555fdd1843d28.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xr06p%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u4c1878d5" id="u4c1878d5" style="color: #000000">的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%2B1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe1f9575d854d5fa5337d5976bf75c0eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BaHdK%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u00727016" id="u00727016" style="color: #000000">个时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bt_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D0%7D%5EM%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4124070c1c6f31c0122f875402add15d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Auh3v%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u1cc36468" id="u1cc36468" style="color: #000000">。令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_0%7D%3Dx_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb546801bbdc546359e4b3ea815e9c512.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WYfDj%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5554a73" id="ua5554a73" style="color: #000000">为初始值。所提出的求解器通过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UCy0L%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u73ecdb75" id="u73ecdb75" style="color: #000000">个迭代步骤，逐步计算一个序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_i%7D%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D0%7D%5EM%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc9563ed86a32f467544ce61ee3fb3770.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a4zcN%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u37b2cb6e" id="u37b2cb6e" style="color: #000000">，以近似对应时间点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bt_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D0%7D%5EM%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4124070c1c6f31c0122f875402add15d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Lhh8N%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u817e94a2" id="u817e94a2" style="color: #000000">处的真实解。特别地，最后一个迭代值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_M%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F026502e3d3cb52d49cb4fb5f6b1c67b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XUBfX%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u29ade134" id="u29ade134" style="color: #000000">用于近似时刻 0 处的真实解</span></p><ul list="u3673d095"><li fid="u17819ae5" data-lake-id="ua63b08ef" id="ua63b08ef"><span data-lake-id="u2b4b9849" id="u2b4b9849" style="color: #000000">为减小</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_M%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F25851e5fab9f5eb4d4a4725e6e3ad237.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KQRWM%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="uadfed339" id="uadfed339" style="color: #000000">与时刻 0 处真实解之间的误差，需要在每一步都尽可能减小各个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_i%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5e9706b70b8d34b1ca33885ff37b0544.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qKh6D%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u6c384f2c" id="u6c384f2c" style="color: #000000">的近似误差。从前一个时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_%7Bi-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56be2748549262f2c6fe1b3dc84b9a6f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fAZJC%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u8c5d278f" id="u8c5d278f" style="color: #000000">的近似值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4c10e80b68bf70486e0808ad66d6f34c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y0nRT%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u5996a53b" id="u5996a53b" style="color: #000000">出发，在时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_i%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F23ef13e9f67f9c0c75becf6d968d7add.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Moraj%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u46b19e23" id="u46b19e23" style="color: #000000">处的精确解</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cto%20t_i%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2c9859f3710273837ac721dd4ab31c18.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dqOAo%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u6e9ae765" id="u6e9ae765" style="color: #000000">可表示为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufdbae431" id="ufdbae431" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cto%20t_i%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%20%5C%5Cint_%7B%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Clambda%7D%20%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%20%5C%5Clambda)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clambda.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdce2044ba6b44ecb325c56cb506a7a8b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ogcdP%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card></p><ul list="u6881e68a"><li fid="u38ad9461" data-lake-id="u0d0872ef" id="u0d0872ef"><span data-lake-id="u40e40f1f" id="u40e40f1f">关键在于近似</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F727cc56318ffb9d9409b2ecfee096cc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YINpQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u172caf34" id="u172caf34">从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff55d3aaa24207eaa907ae401dd959fca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TBpeQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uba2108e7" id="uba2108e7">到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_i%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7bb180137a1686118ca35ce943fb5cfd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LZBnv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7af78b79" id="u7af78b79">区间上的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u563ca9bf" id="u563ca9bf">指数加权积分</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u84e6f0d5" id="u84e6f0d5">。记</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22h_i%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_i%7D-%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F05bd751a0324932e99240ef6382997a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lB9jW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u69a60343" id="u69a60343">并记</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5E%7B(n)%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%5C%5Clambda)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%5En%20%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%5C%5Clambda)%7D%7Bd%5C%5Clambda%5En%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb3f232c787f84a8bda7c2897652e70c6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D3DYk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubd61701e" id="ubd61701e">为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%5C%5Clambda)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4e14561e8480124ee6eafaa404982442.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LIZQR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6abc2ccd" id="u6abc2ccd">关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe520c061a407db472027709bf3f73290.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22adklX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5888e765" id="u5888e765">的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uZWdl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u178dd43c" id="u178dd43c">阶全导数。对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%5C%5Cge%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F741cabf1bc832a91e6bee3b41039ab4f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nGDY8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uee4ffdbe" id="uee4ffdbe">，在 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff55d3aaa24207eaa907ae401dd959fca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zYNWE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0170dd11" id="u0170dd11">处对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%5C%5Clambda)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4e14561e8480124ee6eafaa404982442.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LPWki%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb27b0f1" id="ucb27b0f1">作</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k-1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F35e9ad4e8d4ed4a0df12c72b01f18024.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YQml4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5532ffce" id="u5532ffce">阶泰勒展开，有</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u855bf2fd" id="u855bf2fd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%20%5C%5Clambda)%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bn%3D0%7D%5E%7Bk-1%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B(%5C%5Clambda%20-%20%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D)%5En%7D%7Bn!%7D%20%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(n)%7D(%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7B%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D((%5C%5Clambda%20-%20%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D)%5Ek)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4dcd92adc6ac81f20f0d2769f369ad74.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CTLxm%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u99a25ef8"><li fid="ue5540994" data-lake-id="u28ac05ce" id="u28ac05ce"><span data-lake-id="u78d9849c" id="u78d9849c">将上述泰勒展开代入，可得</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u901dadd5" id="u901dadd5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cto%20t_i%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bn%3D0%7D%5E%7Bk-1%7D%20%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(n)%7D(%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7B%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D)%20%5C%5Cint_%7B%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Clambda%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B(%5C%5Clambda%20-%20%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D)%5En%7D%7Bn!%7D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clambda%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(h_i%5E%7Bk%2B1%7D)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fca54307cc262f58408c3c85af266e4cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x4EKw%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub461f999" id="ub461f999"><span data-lake-id="ub6fa127d" id="ub6fa127d">积分项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cint%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Clambda%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B(%5C%5Clambda-%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D)%5En%7D%7Bn!%7D%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Clambda%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed04cda7041cf4a7aa833a690a883835.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HFdyb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6fe658bd" id="u6fe658bd">可以通过重复应用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F58e9ef90f745f513253970379e805547.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rIMtL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6d44826a" id="u6d44826a">次分部积分解析求得。近似</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20x_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cto%20t_i%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8bca953e98c4ec90a549a369c46d291d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TYGPF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u86f2bd15" id="u86f2bd15">只需要近似</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%5C%5Cle%20k-1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffbd3a0d41207296ef31b3633ea0e6a0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P9v7h%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6b6a1593" id="u6b6a1593">时的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TMjDZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uba5e9a4e" id="uba5e9a4e">阶全导数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5E%7B(n)%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%5C%5Clambda)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb870822bf66d209c59f27ad3e400f2a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cF9tb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u789e793b" id="u789e793b">。通过舍去误差项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(h_i%5E%7Bk%2B1%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F022d0d96a00bd9a19616dd3dd1011443.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IHJGu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u85485c23" id="u85485c23">，并利用所谓的 stiff order conditions 去近似前</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k-1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F35e9ad4e8d4ed4a0df12c72b01f18024.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t7R8y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaf7ca7db" id="uaf7ca7db">阶全导数，便可以构造出扩散 ODE 的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bsdCy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u07df2bf9" id="u07df2bf9">阶求解器。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6e47eacb" id="u6e47eacb" style="color: #000000">将这类求解器统称为 DPM-Solver，而其特定阶数版本记为 DPM-Solver-k</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u61d9f011" id="u61d9f011">。以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F29451a8fe9e2c369b77e30ea1655ac46.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zs25M%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0430bdf2" id="u0430bdf2">的情形为例进行说明</span></p><p data-lake-id="ubdee6530" id="ubdee6530" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cto%20t_i%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%2C%20t_%7Bi-1%7D)%20%5C%5Cint_%7B%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Clambda%7D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clambda%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(h_i%5E2)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csigma_%7Bt_i%7D(e%5E%7Bh_i%7D%20-%201)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%2C%20t_%7Bi-1%7D)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(h_i%5E2).%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F00956fcd5e544e400e31440ed5321232.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YfTkj%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6e6fd768" id="u6e6fd768" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1776693703843-08e4eeb3-c04a-4c88-8b91-1bb2629b6dd0.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uc965469d-f14e-4b3b-8c9b-794f017781b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22udd9f63f2-ccf2-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A894.6364135742188%2C%22height%22%3A140%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A61955%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1415%2C%22originHeight%22%3A221%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22OLVER-L.GIVENANINITIALVALUEWRANDML%2B1TIMESTEPST%22%2C%22x%22%3A128%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A881%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220STARTINGWITHR%E4%B8%89AR%2CTHESEQUENCEWTISCOMPUTEDITERATIV%22%2C%22x%22%3A88%2C%22y%22%3A78%2C%22width%22%3A907%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T%E6%88%9